"Authentication via OAuth 2.0, including GitLab, Google, and Entra ID, "
"will fail."
msgstr "GitLab, Google, Entra ID를 포함한 OAuth 2.0을 통한 인증이 실패합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:64
msgid "Plugins may not work as expected."
msgstr "플러그인이 예상대로 작동하지 않을 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:74
msgid "Maximum URL length"
msgstr "최대 URL 길이"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:77
msgid ""
"The longest URL, in characters, including query parameters, accepted by "
"the Mattermost server. Longer URLs are rejected, and API calls fail with "
"an error."
msgstr "쿼리 매개변수를 포함하여 OKR.BEST 서버가 허용하는 가장 긴 URL의 문자 수입니다. 더 긴 URL은 거부되며 API 호출이 오류와 함께 실패합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:81
msgid "Numeric value. Default is **2048** characters."
msgstr "숫자 값. 기본값은 **2048**자입니다."

