"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``MaximumURLLength`` > "
"``2048``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``MaximumURLLength`` > ``2048``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:79
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_MAXIMUMURLLENGTH``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_MAXIMUMURLLENGTH``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:94
msgid "Web server listen address"
msgstr "웹 서버 수신 주소"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:97
msgid ""
"The address and port to which to bind and listen. Specifying ``:8065`` "
"will bind to all network interfaces. Specifying ``127.0.0.1:8065`` will "
"only bind to the network interface having that IP address."
msgstr "바인딩하고 수신할 주소와 포트입니다. ``:8065``를 지정하면 모든 네트워크 인터페이스에 바인딩됩니다. ``127.0.0.1:8065``를 지정하면 해당 IP 주소를 가진 네트워크 인터페이스에만 바인딩됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:102
msgid ""
"If you choose a port of a lower level (called “system ports” or “well-"
"known ports”, in the range of 0-1023), you must have permissions to bind "
"to that port."
msgstr "하위 수준 포트(0-1023 범위의 “시스템 포트” 또는 “잘 알려진 포트”라고 함)를 선택하는 경우 해당 포트에 바인딩할 권한이 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:98
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``ListenAddress``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``ListenAddress``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:99
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_LISTENADDRESS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_LISTENADDRESS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:109
msgid ""
"Web server uses ``address:port`` (e.g., ``\":8065\"``), while "
":ref:`Metrics <administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-"
"settings:listen address>` uses a port number only (e.g., ``8067``)."
msgstr "웹 서버는 ``address:port``(예: ``\":8065\"``)를 사용하는 반면, :ref:`메트릭 <administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:listen address>`은 포트 번호만 사용합니다(예: ``8067``)."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:121
msgid "Forward port 80 to 443"
msgstr "포트 80을 443으로 전달"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:124
msgid "Forward insecure traffic from port 80 to port 443."
msgstr "포트 80의 안전하지 않은 트래픽을 포트 443으로 전달합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:126
msgid "**true**: Forwards all insecure traffic from port 80 to secure port 443."
msgstr "**true**: 포트 80의 모든 안전하지 않은 트래픽을 보안 포트 443으로 전달합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:128
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** When using a proxy such as NGINX in front of "
"Mattermost this setting is unnecessary and should be set to false."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST 앞에 NGINX와 같은 프록시를 사용하는 경우 이 설정은 불필요하며 false로 설정해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:125
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``Forward80To443`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``Forward80To443`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:126
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_FORWARD80TO443``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_FORWARD80TO443``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:144
msgid "Web server connection security"
msgstr "웹 서버 연결 보안"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:147
msgid "Connection security between Mattermost clients and the server."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 클라이언트와 서버 간의 연결 보안입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:149
msgid "**Not specified**: Mattermost will connect over an unsecure connection."
msgstr "**Not specified**: OKR.BEST가 안전하지 않은 연결을 통해 연결됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:151
msgid ""
"**TLS**: Encrypts the communication between Mattermost clients and your "
"server."
msgstr "**TLS**: OKR.BEST 클라이언트와 서버 간의 통신을 암호화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:148
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``ConnectionSecurity``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``ConnectionSecurity``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:149
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_CONNECTIONSECURITY``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_CONNECTIONSECURITY``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:155
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`setting up TLS for Mattermost </deployment-guide/server"
"/setup-tls>` for details."
msgstr "자세한 내용은 :doc:`OKR.BEST용 TLS 설정 </deployment-guide/server/setup-tls>`을 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:165
msgid "TLS certificate file"
msgstr "TLS 인증서 파일"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:168
msgid "The path to the certificate file to use for TLS connection security."
msgstr "TLS 연결 보안에 사용할 인증서 파일의 경로입니다."

