#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:182
msgid "TLS key file"
msgstr "TLS 키 파일"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:185
msgid "The path to the TLS key file to use for TLS connection security."
msgstr "TLS 연결 보안에 사용할 TLS 키 파일의 경로입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:186
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``TLSKeyFile``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``TLSKeyFile``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:187
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TLSKEYFILE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TLSKEYFILE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:202
msgid "Use Let's Encrypt"
msgstr "Let's Encrypt 사용"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:205
msgid "Enable the automatic retrieval of certificates from Let’s Encrypt."
msgstr "Let’s Encrypt에서 인증서를 자동으로 검색하도록 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:208
msgid ""
"**true**: The certificate will be retrieved when a client attempts to "
"connect from a new domain. This will work with multiple domains."
msgstr "**true**: 클라이언트가 새 도메인에서 연결을 시도할 때 인증서가 검색됩니다. 여러 도메인에서 작동합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:211
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Manual certificate specification based on the "
"TLS Certificate File and TLS Key File specified above."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 위에 지정된 TLS 인증서 파일과 TLS 키 파일을 기반으로 한 수동 인증서 지정입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:206
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``UseLetsEncrypt`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``UseLetsEncrypt`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:207
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_USELETSENCRYPT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_USELETSENCRYPT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:216
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`setting up TLS for Mattermost </deployment-guide/server"
"/setup-tls>` for details on setting up Let's Encrypt."
msgstr "Let's Encrypt 설정에 대한 자세한 내용은 :doc:`OKR.BEST용 TLS 설정 </deployment-guide/server/setup-tls>`을 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:226
msgid "Let's Encrypt certificate cache file"
msgstr "Let's Encrypt 인증서 캐시 파일"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:229
msgid ""
"The path to the file where certificates and other data about the Let’s "
"Encrypt service will be stored."
msgstr "Let’s Encrypt 서비스에 대한 인증서 및 기타 데이터가 저장될 파일의 경로입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:232
msgid "File path input."
msgstr "파일 경로 입력."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:230
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``LetsEncryptCertificateCacheFile``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``LetsEncryptCertificateCacheFile``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:231
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_LETSENCRYPTCERTIFICATECACHEFILE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_LETSENCRYPTCERTIFICATECACHEFILE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:243
msgid "Read timeout"
msgstr "읽기 시간 초과"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:246
msgid ""
"Maximum time allowed from when the connection is accepted to when the "
"request body is fully read."
msgstr "연결이 수락된 시점부터 요청 본문이 완전히 읽힐 때까지 허용되는 최대 시간입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:249
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:272
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:290
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:859
msgid "Numerical input in seconds. Default is **300** seconds."
msgstr "초 단위 숫자 입력. 기본값은 **300**초입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:247
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``ReadTimeout`` > ``300``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``ReadTimeout`` > ``300``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:248
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_READTIMEOUT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_READTIMEOUT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:263
msgid "Write timeout"
msgstr "쓰기 시간 초과"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:266
msgid ""
"If using HTTP (insecure), this is the maximum time allowed from the end "
"of reading the request headers until the response is written."
msgstr "HTTP(안전하지 않음)를 사용하는 경우 요청 헤더 읽기가 끝난 시점부터 응답이 작성될 때까지 허용되는 최대 시간입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:269
msgid ""
"If using HTTPS, it's the total time from when the connection is accepted "
"until the response is written."
msgstr "HTTPS를 사용하는 경우 연결이 수락된 시점부터 응답이 작성될 때까지의 총 시간입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:267
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``WriteTimeout`` > ``300``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``WriteTimeout`` > ``300``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:268
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_WRITETIMEOUT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_WRITETIMEOUT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:283
msgid "Idle timeout"
msgstr "유휴 시간 초과"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:286
msgid ""
"Set an explicit idle timeout in the HTTP server. This is the maximum time"
" allowed before an idle connection is disconnected."
msgstr "HTTP 서버에서 명시적인 유휴 시간 초과를 설정합니다. 유휴 연결이 끊어지기 전까지 허용되는 최대 시간입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:287
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``IdleTimeout`` > ``300``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``IdleTimeout`` > ``300``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:288
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_IDLETIMEOUT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_IDLETIMEOUT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:304
msgid "Webserver mode"
msgstr "웹 서버 모드"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:307
msgid ""
"We recommend gzip to improve performance unless your environment has "
"specific restrictions, such as a web proxy that distributes gzip files "
"poorly."
msgstr "gzip 파일을 제대로 배포하지 못하는 웹 프록시와 같은 특정 제한이 환경에 없는 한 성능 향상을 위해 gzip을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:311
msgid ""
"**gzip**: **(Default)** The Mattermost server will serve static files "
"compressed with gzip to improve performance. gzip compression applies to "
"the HTML, CSS, Javascript, and other static content files that make up "
"the Mattermost web client."
msgstr "**gzip**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST 서버가 성능 향상을 위해 gzip으로 압축된 정적 파일을 제공합니다. gzip 압축은 OKR.BEST 웹 클라이언트를 구성하는 HTML, CSS, Javascript 및 기타 정적 콘텐츠 파일에 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:315
msgid ""
"**Uncompressed**: The Mattermost server will serve static files "
"uncompressed."
msgstr "**Uncompressed**: OKR.BEST 서버가 정적 파일을 압축하지 않고 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:317
msgid "**Disabled**: The Mattermost server will not serve static files."
msgstr "**Disabled**: OKR.BEST 서버가 정적 파일을 제공하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:308
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``WebserverMode`` > "
"``\"gzip\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``WebserverMode`` > ``\"gzip\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:309
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_WEBSERVERMODE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_WEBSERVERMODE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:330
msgid "Enable insecure outgoing connections"
msgstr "안전하지 않은 발신 연결 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:333
msgid "Configure Mattermost to allow insecure outgoing connections."
msgstr "안전하지 않은 발신 연결을 허용하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:335
msgid ""
"**true**: Outgoing HTTPS requests, including S3 clients, can accept "
"unverified, self-signed certificates. For example, outgoing webhooks to a"
" server with a self-signed TLS certificate, using any domain, will be "
"allowed, and will skip TLS verification."
msgstr "**true**: S3 클라이언트를 포함한 발신 HTTPS 요청이 확인되지 않은 자체 서명 인증서를 수락할 수 있습니다. 예를 들어, 모든 도메인을 사용하여 자체 서명 TLS 인증서가 있는 서버로의 발신 웹훅이 허용되며 TLS 확인을 건너뜁니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:340
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Only secure HTTPS requests are allowed."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 보안 HTTPS 요청만 허용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:334
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``EnableInsecureOutgoingConnections`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableInsecureOutgoingConnections`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:335
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEINSECUREOUTGOINGCONNECTIONS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEINSECUREOUTGOINGCONNECTIONS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:346
msgid ""
"Enabling this feature makes these connections susceptible to man-in-the-"
"middle attacks."
msgstr "이 기능을 활성화하면 이러한 연결이 중간자 공격에 취약해집니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:356
msgid "Managed resource paths"
msgstr "관리되는 리소스 경로"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:359
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of paths within the Mattermost domain that are "
"managed by a third party service instead of Mattermost itself."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 자체가 아닌 타사 서비스에서 관리하는 OKR.BEST 도메인 내 경로의 쉼표로 구분된 목록입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:363
msgid ""
"Links to these paths will be opened in a new tab/window by Mattermost "
"apps."
msgstr "이러한 경로에 대한 링크는 OKR.BEST 앱에서 새 탭/창으로 열립니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:366
msgid ""
"For example, if Mattermost is running on ``https://mymattermost.com``, "
"setting this to conference will cause links such as "
"``https://mymattermost.com/conference`` to open in a new window."
msgstr "예를 들어, OKR.BEST가 ``https://mymattermost.com``에서 실행 중인 경우 이를 conference로 설정하면 ``https://mymattermost.com/conference``와 같은 링크가 새 창으로 열립니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:360
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``ManagedResourcePaths``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``ManagedResourcePaths``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:361
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_MANAGEDRESOURCEPATHS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_MANAGEDRESOURCEPATHS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:375
msgid ""
"When using the Mattermost Desktop App, additional configuration is "
"required to open the link within the Desktop App instead of in a browser."
" See the :doc:`desktop managed resources </deployment-guide/desktop"
"/desktop-app-managed-resources>` documentation for details."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱을 사용하는 경우 브라우저 대신 데스크톱 앱 내에서 링크를 열려면 추가 구성이 필요합니다. 자세한 내용은 :doc:`데스크톱 관리되는 리소스 </deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-managed-resources>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:378
msgid "Reload configuration from disk"
msgstr "디스크에서 구성 다시 로드"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/ent-plus.rst:9
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Enterprise and Enterprise Advanced plans"
" <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr "|plans-img-yellow| `Enterprise and Enterprise Advanced 플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__에서 사용 가능"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:384
msgid ""
"You must change the database line in the ``config.json`` file, and then "
"reload configuration to fail over without taking the server down."
msgstr "서버를 중단하지 않고 장애 조치하려면 ``config.json`` 파일의 데이터베이스 라인을 변경한 다음 구성을 다시 로드해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:388
msgid ""
"Select the **Reload configuration from disk** button in the System "
"Console after changing your database configuration. Then, go to "
"**Environment > Database** and select **Recycle Database Connections** to"
" complete the reload."
msgstr "데이터베이스 구성을 변경한 후 관리자 도구에서 **Reload configuration from disk** 버튼을 선택합니다. 그런 다음 **Environment > Database**로 이동하여 **Recycle Database Connections**를 선택하여 다시 로드를 완료합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:385
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:400
