msgid "Environment variable: N/A"
msgstr "환경 변수: 해당 없음"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:396
msgid "Purge all caches"
msgstr "모든 캐시 제거"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:399
msgid "Purge all in-memory caches for sessions, accounts, and channels."
msgstr "세션, 계정, 채널에 대한 모든 인메모리 캐시를 제거합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:402
msgid ""
"Select the **Purge All Caches** button in the System Console to purge all"
" caches."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Purge All Caches** 버튼을 선택하여 모든 캐시를 제거합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:408
msgid ""
"Purging the caches may adversely impact performance. :doc:`high "
"availability cluster-based deployments </administration-guide/scale/high-"
"availability-cluster-based-deployment>` will attempt to purge all the "
"servers in the cluster."
msgstr "캐시를 제거하면 성능에 부정적인 영향을 미칠 수 있습니다. :doc:`고가용성 클러스터 기반 배포 </administration-guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-deployment>`는 클러스터의 모든 서버를 제거하려고 시도합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:418
msgid "Websocket URL"
msgstr "웹소켓 URL"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:421
msgid ""
"You can configure the server to instruct clients on where they should try"
" to connect websockets to."
msgstr "클라이언트가 웹소켓을 연결하려고 시도해야 하는 위치를 지시하도록 서버를 구성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:422
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``WebsocketURL`` > ``\"\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``WebsocketURL`` > ``\"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:423
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_WEBSOCKETURL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_WEBSOCKETURL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:429
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend configuring a single websocket URL that matches the"
" `Site URL <#site-url>`_ configuration setting."
msgstr "`사이트 URL <#site-url>`_ 구성 설정과 일치하는 단일 웹소켓 URL을 구성할 것을 강력히 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:439
msgid "License file location"
msgstr "라이선스 파일 위치"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:442
msgid ""
"The path and filename of the license file on disk. On startup, if "
"Mattermost can't find a valid license in the database from a previous "
"upload, it looks in this path for the license file."
msgstr "디스크에 있는 라이선스 파일의 경로와 파일 이름입니다. 시작 시 OKR.BEST가 이전 업로드에서 데이터베이스에 유효한 라이선스를 찾을 수 없는 경우 이 경로에서 라이선스 파일을 찾습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:447
msgid ""
"String input. Can be an absolute path or a path relative to the "
"``mattermost`` directory."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 절대 경로 또는 ``mattermost`` 디렉토리에 대한 상대 경로일 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:443
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``LicenseFileLocation`` > "
"``\"\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``LicenseFileLocation`` > ``\"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:444
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_LICENSEFILELOCATION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_LICENSEFILELOCATION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:459
msgid "TLS minimum version"
msgstr "TLS 최소 버전"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:462
msgid "The minimum TLS version used by the Mattermost server."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 서버에서 사용하는 최소 TLS 버전입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:464
msgid "String input. Default is **1.2**."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 기본값은 **1.2**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:463
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``TLSMinVer`` > ``1.2``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``TLSMinVer`` > ``1.2``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:464
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TLSMINVER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TLSMINVER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:469
msgid ""
"This setting only takes effect if you are using the built-in server "
"binary directly, and not using a reverse proxy layer, such as NGINX."
msgstr "이 설정은 내장 서버 바이너리를 직접 사용하고 NGINX와 같은 리버스 프록시 계층을 사용하지 않는 경우에만 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:479
msgid "Trusted proxy IP header"
msgstr "신뢰할 수 있는 프록시 IP 헤더"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:482
msgid ""
"Specified headers that will be checked, one by one, for IP addresses "
"(order is important). All other headers are ignored."
msgstr "IP 주소에 대해 하나씩 확인할 지정된 헤더입니다(순서가 중요함). 다른 모든 헤더는 무시됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:486
msgid ""
"String array input consisting of header names, such as ``[\"X-Forwarded-"
"For\", \"X-Real-Ip\"]``."
msgstr "``[\"X-Forwarded-For\", \"X-Real-Ip\"]``와 같은 헤더 이름으로 구성된 문자열 배열 입력입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:483
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``TrustedProxyIPHeader`` >"
" ``[]``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``TrustedProxyIPHeader`` > ``[]``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:484
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TRUSTEDPROXYIPHEADER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TRUSTEDPROXYIPHEADER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:492
msgid "The default value of ``[]`` means that no header will be trusted."
msgstr "기본값 ``[]``는 어떤 헤더도 신뢰되지 않음을 의미합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:493
msgid ""
"We recommend keeping the default setting when Mattermost is running "
"without a proxy to avoid the client sending the headers and bypassing "
"rate limiting and/or the audit log."
msgstr "클라이언트가 헤더를 전송하여 속도 제한 및/또는 감사 로그를 우회하는 것을 방지하기 위해 OKR.BEST가 프록시 없이 실행될 때는 기본 설정을 유지할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:494
msgid ""
"For environments that use a reverse proxy, this issue does not exist, "
"provided that the headers are set by the reverse proxy. In those "
"environments, only explicitly whitelist the header set by the reverse "
"proxy and no additional values."
msgstr "리버스 프록시를 사용하는 환경에서는 헤더가 리버스 프록시에 의해 설정되는 경우 이 문제가 발생하지 않습니다. 이러한 환경에서는 리버스 프록시가 설정한 헤더만 명시적으로 화이트리스트에 추가하고 추가 값은 추가하지 마세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:506
msgid "Enable Strict Transport Security (HSTS)"
msgstr "엄격한 전송 보안(HSTS) 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:509
msgid ""
"**true**: Adds the Strict Transport Security (HSTS) header to all "
"responses, forcing the browser to request all resources via HTTPS."
msgstr "**true**: 모든 응답에 엄격한 전송 보안(HSTS) 헤더를 추가하여 브라우저가 HTTPS를 통해 모든 리소스를 요청하도록 강제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:512
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** No restrictions on TLS transport. Strict "
"Transport Security (HSTS) header isn't added to responses."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** TLS 전송에 제한이 없습니다. 엄격한 전송 보안(HSTS) 헤더가 응답에 추가되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:510
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``TLSStrictTransport`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``TLSStrictTransport`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:511
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TLSSTRICTTRANSPORT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TLSSTRICTTRANSPORT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:517
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:538
msgid ""
"See the `Strict-Transport-Security <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Strict-Transport-Security>`__ documentation for "
"details."
msgstr "자세한 내용은 `Strict-Transport-Security <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Strict-Transport-Security>`__ 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:527
msgid "Secure TLS transport expiry"
msgstr "보안 TLS 전송 만료"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:530
msgid ""
"The time, in seconds, that the browser remembers a site is only to be "
"accessed using HTTPS. After this period, a site can't be accessed using "
"HTTP unless ``TLSStrictTransport`` is set to ``true``."
msgstr "브라우저가 사이트에 HTTPS를 사용해서만 액세스해야 한다고 기억하는 시간(초)입니다. 이 기간 이후에는 ``TLSStrictTransport``가 ``true``로 설정되지 않는 한 HTTP를 사용하여 사이트에 액세스할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:535
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **63072000** (2 years)."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **63072000**(2년)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:531
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``TLSStrictTransportMaxAge`` > ``63072000``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``TLSStrictTransportMaxAge`` > ``63072000``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:532
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TLSSTRICTTRANSPORTMAXAGE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TLSSTRICTTRANSPORTMAXAGE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:548
msgid "TLS cipher overwrites"
msgstr "TLS 암호 덮어쓰기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:551
msgid ""
"Set TLS ciphers overwrites to meet requirements from legacy clients which"
" don't support modern ciphers, or to limit the types of accepted ciphers."
msgstr "최신 암호를 지원하지 않는 레거시 클라이언트의 요구 사항을 충족하거나 허용되는 암호 유형을 제한하기 위해 TLS 암호 덮어쓰기를 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:555
msgid ""
"If none specified, the Mattermost server assumes a set of currently "
"considered secure ciphers, and allows overwrites in the edge case."
msgstr "지정되지 않은 경우 OKR.BEST 서버는 현재 안전한 것으로 간주되는 암호 집합을 가정하며 엣지 케이스에서 덮어쓰기를 허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:559
msgid "String array input."
msgstr "문자열 배열 입력."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:552
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``TLSOverwriteCiphers`` > "
"``[]``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``TLSOverwriteCiphers`` > ``[]``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:553
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TLSOVERWRITECIPHERS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TLSOVERWRITECIPHERS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:564
msgid ""
"This setting only takes effect if you are using the built-in server "
"binary directly and not using a reverse proxy layer, such as NGINX."
msgstr "이 설정은 내장 서버 바이너리를 직접 사용하고 NGINX와 같은 리버스 프록시 계층을 사용하지 않는 경우에만 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:565
msgid ""
"See the ``ServerTLSSupportedCiphers`` variable in `/model/config.go "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/blob/master/server/public/model/config.go>`__"
" for a list of ciphers considered secure."
msgstr "안전한 것으로 간주되는 암호 목록은 `/model/config.go <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/blob/master/server/public/model/config.go>`__의 ``ServerTLSSupportedCiphers`` 변수를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:575
msgid "Goroutine health threshold"
msgstr "고루틴 상태 임계값"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:578
msgid ""
"Set a threshold on the number of goroutines when the Mattermost system is"
" considered to be in a healthy state."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 시스템이 정상 상태로 간주될 때의 고루틴 수에 대한 임계값을 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:582
msgid ""
"When goroutines exceed this limit, a warning is returned in the server "
"logs."
msgstr "고루틴이 이 제한을 초과하면 서버 로그에 경고가 반환됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:585
msgid ""
"Numeric input. Default is **-1** which turns off checking for the "
"threshold."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **-1**이며, 임계값 검사를 끕니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:579
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``GoroutineHealthThreshold`` > ``-1``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``GoroutineHealthThreshold`` > ``-1``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:580
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_GOROUTINEHEALTHTHRESHOLD``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_GOROUTINEHEALTHTHRESHOLD``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:599
msgid "Allow cookies for subdomains"
msgstr "하위 도메인에 대한 쿠키 허용"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:602
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Allows cookies for subdomains by setting the "
"domain parameter on Mattermost cookies."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST 쿠키에 도메인 매개변수를 설정하여 하위 도메인에 대한 쿠키를 허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:605
msgid "**false**: Cookies aren't allowed for subdomains."
msgstr "**false**: 하위 도메인에 대한 쿠키가 허용되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:603
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``AllowCookiesForSubdomains`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``AllowCookiesForSubdomains`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:604
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ALLOWCOOKIESFORSUBDOMAINS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ALLOWCOOKIESFORSUBDOMAINS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:616
msgid "Cluster log timeout"
msgstr "클러스터 로그 시간 초과"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:622
msgid ""
"Define the frequency, in milliseconds, of cluster request time logging "
"for performance monitoring."
msgstr "성능 모니터링을 위한 클러스터 요청 시간 로깅의 빈도(밀리초)를 정의합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:626
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **2000** milliseconds (2 seconds)."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **2000**밀리초(2초)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:623
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``ClusterLogTimeoutMilliseconds`` > ``2000``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``ClusterLogTimeoutMilliseconds`` > ``2000``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:624
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_CLUSTERLOGTIMEOUTMILLISECONDS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_CLUSTERLOGTIMEOUTMILLISECONDS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:630
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`performance monitoring </administration-guide/scale/deploy-"
"prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring>` documentation for "
"details."
msgstr "자세한 내용은 :doc:`성능 모니터링 </administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:640
msgid "Maximum payload size"
msgstr "최대 페이로드 크기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:643
msgid ""
"The maximum payload size in bytes for all APIs except APIs that receive a"
" file as an input."
msgstr "파일을 입력으로 받는 API를 제외한 모든 API의 최대 페이로드 크기(바이트)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:646
msgid ""
"For example, the upload attachment API or the API to upload a custom "
"emoji."
msgstr "예를 들어, 첨부 파일 업로드 API 또는 사용자 지정 이모지 업로드 API입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:649
msgid "Numerical value. Default is **300000** (300 kB)."
msgstr "숫자 값. 기본값은 **300000**(300 kB)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:644
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``MaximumPayloadSizeBytes`` > ``300000``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``MaximumPayloadSizeBytes`` > ``300000``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:645
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_MAXIMUMPAYLOADSIZEBYTES``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_MAXIMUMPAYLOADSIZEBYTES``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:655
msgid "Database"
msgstr "데이터베이스"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:657
msgid ""
"With self-hosted deployments, you can configure the database environment "
"in which Mattermost is deployed by going to **System Console > "
"Environment > Database**, or by editing the ``config.json`` file as "
"described in the following tables. Changes to configuration settings in "
"this section require a server restart before taking effect."
msgstr "셀프 호스팅 배포에서는 **System Console > Environment > Database**로 이동하거나 다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집하여 OKR.BEST가 배포되는 데이터베이스 환경을 구성할 수 있습니다. 이 섹션의 구성 설정을 변경하면 적용되기 전에 서버를 다시 시작해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:667
msgid "Driver name"
msgstr "드라이버 이름"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:670
msgid "The type of database. Can be either:"
msgstr "데이터베이스 유형입니다. 다음 중 하나일 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:672
msgid "**mysql**: **(Default)** Enables driver to MySQL database."
msgstr "**mysql**: **(기본값)** MySQL 데이터베이스에 대한 드라이버를 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:673
msgid "**postgres**: Enables driver to PostgreSQL database."
msgstr "**postgres**: PostgreSQL 데이터베이스에 대한 드라이버를 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:671
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > ``DriverName``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``DriverName``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:672
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_DRIVERNAME``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_DRIVERNAME``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:684
msgid "Data source"
msgstr "데이터 소스"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:687
msgid "The connection string to the master database."
msgstr "마스터 데이터베이스에 대한 연결 문자열입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:688
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > ``DataSource``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``DataSource``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:689
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_DATASOURCE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_DATASOURCE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:694
msgid "PostgreSQL databases"
msgstr "PostgreSQL 데이터베이스"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:696
msgid ""
"When **Driver Name** is set to postgres, use a connection string in the "
"form of: "
"``postgres://mmuser:password@hostname_or_IP:5432/mattermost_test?sslmode=disable&connect_timeout=10``"
msgstr "**Driver Name**이 postgres로 설정된 경우 ``postgres://mmuser:password@hostname_or_IP:5432/mattermost_test?sslmode=disable&connect_timeout=10`` 형식의 연결 문자열을 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:699
msgid "**To use TLS with PostgreSQL databases**"
msgstr "**PostgreSQL 데이터베이스에서 TLS를 사용하려면**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:701
msgid ""
"The parameter to encrypt connection against a PostgreSQL server is "
"sslmode. The library used to interact with PostgreSQL server is `pq "
"<https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/lib/pq>`__. Currently, it's not possible "
"to use all the values that you could pass to a standard PostgreSQL Client"
" ``psql \"sslmode=value\"`` See the `SSL Mode Descriptions "
"<https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/libpq-ssl.html>`__ documentation"
" for details."
msgstr "PostgreSQL 서버에 대한 연결을 암호화하는 매개변수는 sslmode입니다. PostgreSQL 서버와 상호 작용하는 데 사용되는 라이브러리는 `pq <https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/lib/pq>`__입니다. 현재 표준 PostgreSQL 클라이언트 ``psql \"sslmode=value\"``에 전달할 수 있는 모든 값을 사용할 수는 없습니다. 자세한 내용은 `SSL Mode Descriptions <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/libpq-ssl.html>`__ 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:703
msgid ""
"Your database admin must configure the functionality according to the "
"supported values described below."
msgstr "데이터베이스 관리자는 아래에 설명된 지원 값에 따라 기능을 구성해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:706
msgid "Short description of the ``sslmode`` parameter"
msgstr "``sslmode`` 매개변수에 대한 간단한 설명"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:706
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:766
msgid "Value"
msgstr "값"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:706
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:766
msgid "Example of a data source name"
msgstr "데이터 소스 이름 예시"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:709
msgid "Don't use TLS / SSL encryption against the PostgreSQL server."
msgstr "PostgreSQL 서버에 대해 TLS/SSL 암호화를 사용하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:712
msgid "Default value in file ``config.json``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 파일의 기본값"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:709
msgid "``disable``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:709
msgid ""
"``postgres://mmuser:password@hostname_or_IP:5432/mattermost_test "
"?sslmode=disable&connect_timeout=10``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:714
msgid "The data is encrypted and the network is trusted."
msgstr "데이터가 암호화되고 네트워크가 신뢰됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:717
msgid "Default value is ``sslmode`` when omitted."
msgstr "생략하면 기본값은 ``sslmode``입니다."

