#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:728
msgid "MySQL Databases"
msgstr "MySQL 데이터베이스"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:730
msgid ""
"When Driver Name is set to mysql, we recommend using collation over using"
" charset."
msgstr "Driver Name이 mysql로 설정된 경우 charset보다 collation을 사용할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:732
msgid "To specify collation:"
msgstr "collation을 지정하려면:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:741
msgid ""
"If collation is omitted, the default collation, ``utf8mb4_general_ci`` is"
" used:"
msgstr "collation을 생략하면 기본 collation인 ``utf8mb4_general_ci``가 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:752
msgid ""
"If you’re using MySQL 8.0 or later, the default collation has changed to "
"``utf8mb4_0900_ai_ci``. See our :doc:`Database Software Requirements "
"</deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements>` documentation for "
"details on MySQL 8.0 support."
msgstr "MySQL 8.0 이상을 사용하는 경우 기본 collation이 ``utf8mb4_0900_ai_ci``로 변경되었습니다. MySQL 8.0 지원에 대한 자세한 내용은 :doc:`데이터베이스 소프트웨어 요구 사항 </deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:754
msgid "**To use TLS with MySQL Databases**"
msgstr "**MySQL 데이터베이스에서 TLS를 사용하려면**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:756
msgid "The parameter to encrypt connection against a MySQL server is ``tls``."
msgstr "MySQL 서버에 대한 연결을 암호화하는 매개변수는 ``tls``입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:758
msgid ""
"The library used to interact with MySQL is `Go-MySQL-Driver "
"<https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/go-sql-driver/mysql>`__."
msgstr "MySQL과 상호 작용하는 데 사용되는 라이브러리는 `Go-MySQL-Driver <https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/go-sql-driver/mysql>`__입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:760
msgid ""
"For the moment, it's not possible to use all the values that you could "
"pass to a standard MySQL Client ``mysql --ssl-mode=value``. See "
"`Connection-Encryption Option Summary "
"<https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/connection-options.html"
"#option_general_ssl-mode>`__ documentation for a version 8.0 example."
msgstr "현재 표준 MySQL 클라이언트 ``mysql --ssl-mode=value``에 전달할 수 있는 모든 값을 사용할 수는 없습니다. 8.0 버전 예시는 `Connection-Encryption Option Summary <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/connection-options.html#option_general_ssl-mode>`__ 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:763
msgid ""
"Your database admin must configure the functionality according to "
"supported values described below."
msgstr "데이터베이스 관리자는 아래에 설명된 지원 값에 따라 기능을 구성해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:766
msgid "Short description of the ``tls`` parameter"
msgstr "``tls`` 매개변수에 대한 간단한 설명"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:769
msgid "Don't use TLS / SSL encryption against MySQL server."
msgstr "MySQL 서버에 대해 TLS/SSL 암호화를 사용하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:769
msgid "``false``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:769
msgid ""
"``\"<mmuser:password>@tcp(hostname or IP:3306)/mattermost_test "
"?charset=utf8mb4,utf8&writeTimeout=30s&tls=false\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:772
msgid "Use TLS / SSL encryption against MySQL server."
msgstr "MySQL 서버에 대해 TLS/SSL 암호화를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:772
msgid "``true``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:772
msgid ""
"``\"<mmuser:password>@tcp(hostname or IP:3306)/mattermost_test "
"?charset=utf8mb4,utf8&writeTimeout=30s&tls=true\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:775
msgid ""
"Use TLS / SSL encryption with a self- signed certificate against MySQL "
"server."
msgstr "MySQL 서버에 대해 자체 서명 인증서로 TLS/SSL 암호화를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:775
msgid "``skip-verify``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:775
msgid ""
"``\"<mmuser:password>@tcp(hostname or IP:3306)/mattermost_test "
"?charset=utf8mb4,utf8&writeTimeout=30s&tls=skip-verify\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:779
msgid ""
"Use TLS / SSL encryption if server advertises a possible fallback; "
"unencrypted if it's not advertised."
msgstr "서버가 가능한 폴백을 광고하는 경우 TLS/SSL 암호화를 사용하고, 광고하지 않는 경우 암호화하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:779
msgid "``preferred``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:779
msgid ""
"``\"<mmuser:password>@tcp(hostname or IP:3306)/mattermost_test "
"?charset=utf8mb4,utf8&writeTimeout=30s&tls=preferred\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:785
msgid "AWS High Availablity RDS cluster deployments"
msgstr "AWS 고가용성 RDS 클러스터 배포"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:787
msgid ""
"For an AWS High Availability RDS cluster deployment, point this "
"configuration setting to the write/read endpoint at the **cluster** level"
" to benefit from the AWS failover handling. AWS takes care of promoting "
"different database nodes to be the writer node. Mattermost doesn't need "
"to manage this. See the :ref:`high availablility database configuration "
"<administration-guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-"
"deployment:database configuration>` documentation for details."
msgstr "AWS 고가용성 RDS 클러스터 배포의 경우 AWS 장애 조치 처리의 이점을 활용하기 위해 이 구성 설정을 **클러스터** 수준의 쓰기/읽기 엔드포인트로 지정합니다. AWS는 여러 데이터베이스 노드를 작성기 노드로 승격하는 작업을 처리합니다. OKR.BEST는 이를 관리할 필요가 없습니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`고가용성 데이터베이스 구성 <administration-guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-deployment:database configuration>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:799
msgid "Maximum open connections"
msgstr "최대 열린 연결 수"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:802
msgid "The maximum number of open connections to the database."
msgstr "데이터베이스에 대한 최대 열린 연결 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:805
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/rate-limiting-configuration-settings.rst:69
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **100**."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **100**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:802
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:819
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:856
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:873
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:893
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:911
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:934
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:949
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:975
msgid "System Config path: **Environment > Database**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Environment > Database**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:803
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > ``MaxOpenConns`` > ``100``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``MaxOpenConns`` > ``100``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:804
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_MAXOPENCONNS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_MAXOPENCONNS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:816
msgid "Maximum idle connections"
msgstr "최대 유휴 연결 수"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:819
msgid "The maximum number of idle connections held open to the database."
msgstr "데이터베이스에 대해 열린 상태로 유지되는 최대 유휴 연결 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:822
msgid ""
"Numerical input. Default is **50**. A 2:1 ratio with MaxOpenConns is "
"recommended."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **50**입니다. MaxOpenConns와 2:1 비율을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:820
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > ``MaxIdleConns`` > ``50``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``MaxIdleConns`` > ``50``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:821
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_MAXIDLECONNS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_MAXIDLECONNS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:834
msgid "Query timeout"
msgstr "쿼리 시간 초과"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:852
msgid "Analytics query timeout"
msgstr "분석 쿼리 시간 초과"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:855
msgid ""
"The number of seconds to wait for a response from the database after "
"opening a connection and sending certain analytics queries. This setting "
"only applies to long queries which are run in the background to populate "
"some information in the Team and Site Statistics pages."
msgstr "연결을 열고 특정 분석 쿼리를 보낸 후 데이터베이스의 응답을 기다리는 시간(초)입니다. 이 설정은 Team and Site Statistics 페이지의 일부 정보를 채우기 위해 백그라운드에서 실행되는 긴 쿼리에만 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:855
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > ``AnalyticsQueryTimeout`` > "
"``300``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``AnalyticsQueryTimeout`` > ``300``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:857
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_ANALYTICSQUERYTIMEOUT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_ANALYTICSQUERYTIMEOUT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:870
msgid "Maximum connection lifetime"
msgstr "최대 연결 수명"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:873
msgid ""
"Maximum lifetime for a connection to the database, in milliseconds. Use "
"this setting to configure the maximum amount of time a connection to the "
"database may be reused"
msgstr "데이터베이스에 대한 연결의 최대 수명(밀리초)입니다. 이 설정을 사용하여 데이터베이스에 대한 연결을 재사용할 수 있는 최대 시간을 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:878
msgid ""
"Numerical input in milliseconds. Default is **3600000** milliseconds (1 "
"hour)."
msgstr "밀리초 단위 숫자 입력. 기본값은 **3600000**밀리초(1시간)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:874
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > "
"``ConnMaxLifetimeMilliseconds`` > ``3600000``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``ConnMaxLifetimeMilliseconds`` > ``3600000``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:875
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_CONNMAXLIFETIMEMILLISECONDS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_CONNMAXLIFETIMEMILLISECONDS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:890
msgid "Maximum connection idle timeout"
msgstr "최대 연결 유휴 시간 초과"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:893
msgid "Maximum time a database connection can remain idle, in milliseconds."
msgstr "데이터베이스 연결이 유휴 상태로 유지될 수 있는 최대 시간(밀리초)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:896
msgid "Numerical input in milliseconds. Default is **300000** (5 minutes)."
msgstr "밀리초 단위 숫자 입력. 기본값은 **300000**(5분)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:894
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > "
"``ConnMaxIdleTimeMilliseconds`` > ``300000``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``ConnMaxIdleTimeMilliseconds`` > ``300000``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:895
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_CONNMAXIDLETIMEMILLISECONDS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_CONNMAXIDLETIMEMILLISECONDS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:908
msgid "Minimum hashtag length"
msgstr "최소 해시태그 길이"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:911
msgid ""
"Minimum number of characters in a hashtag. This value must be greater "
"than or equal to **2**."
msgstr "해시태그의 최소 문자 수입니다. 이 값은 **2** 이상이어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:912
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > ``MinimumHashtagLength`` > "
"``3``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``MinimumHashtagLength`` > ``3``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:913
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_MINIMUMHASHTAGLENGTH``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_MINIMUMHASHTAGLENGTH``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:918
msgid ""
"MySQL databases must be configured to support searching strings shorter "
"than three characters. See the `MySQL documentation "
"<https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/fulltext-fine-tuning.html>`__ "
"for details."
msgstr "MySQL 데이터베이스는 세 문자보다 짧은 문자열 검색을 지원하도록 구성해야 합니다. 자세한 내용은 `MySQL 문서 <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/fulltext-fine-tuning.html>`__를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:931
msgid "SQL statement logging"
msgstr "SQL 문 로깅"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:934
msgid "Executed SQL statements can be written to the log for development."
msgstr "실행된 SQL 문을 개발용 로그에 기록할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:937
msgid "**true**: Executing SQL statements are written to the log."
msgstr "**true**: 실행 중인 SQL 문이 로그에 기록됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:938
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** SQL statements aren't written to the log."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** SQL 문이 로그에 기록되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:935
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > ``Trace`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``Trace`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:936
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_TRACE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_TRACE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:943
msgid "Recycle database connections"
msgstr "데이터베이스 연결 재활용"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:949
msgid ""
"Select the **Recycle Database Connections** button to manually recycle "
"the connection pool by closing the current set of open connections to the"
" database within 20 seconds, and then creating a new set of connections."
msgstr "**Recycle Database Connections** 버튼을 선택하여 20초 이내에 데이터베이스에 대한 현재 열린 연결 집합을 닫은 다음 새 연결 집합을 생성하여 연결 풀을 수동으로 재활용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:955
msgid ""
"To fail over without stopping the server, change the database line in the"
" ``config.json`` file, select **Reload Configuration from Disk** via "
"**Environment > Web Server**, then select **Recycle Database "
"Connections**."
msgstr "서버를 중지하지 않고 장애 조치하려면 ``config.json`` 파일의 데이터베이스 라인을 변경하고 **Environment > Web Server**를 통해 **Reload Configuration from Disk**를 선택한 다음 **Recycle Database Connections**를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:972
msgid "Disable database search"
msgstr "데이터베이스 검색 비활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:975
msgid ""
"When :doc:`enterprise-scale search </administration-guide/scale"
"/enterprise-search>`, database search can be disabled from performing "
"searches."
msgstr ":doc:`엔터프라이즈 규모 검색 </administration-guide/scale/enterprise-search>`을 사용할 때 데이터베이스 검색이 검색을 수행하지 않도록 비활성화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:978
msgid ""
"**true**: Disables the use of the database to perform searches. If "
"another search engine isn't configured, setting this value to ``true`` "
"will result in empty search results."
msgstr "**true**: 검색 수행을 위한 데이터베이스 사용을 비활성화합니다. 다른 검색 엔진이 구성되지 않은 경우 이 값을 ``true``로 설정하면 검색 결과가 비어 있게 됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:982
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Database search isn't disabled."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 데이터베이스 검색이 비활성화되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:976
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > ``DisableDatabaseSearch`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``DisableDatabaseSearch`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:977
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_DISABLEDATABASESEARCH``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_DISABLEDATABASESEARCH``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:985
msgid "Search behavior in Mattermost depends on which search engines are enabled:"
msgstr "OKR.BEST의 검색 동작은 어떤 검색 엔진이 활성화되어 있는지에 따라 달라집니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:987
msgid ""
"When :doc:`Elasticsearch </administration-guide/scale/elasticsearch-"
"setup>` or :doc:`AWS OpenSearch </administration-guide/scale/opensearch-"
"setup>` is enabled, Mattermost will try to use it first."
msgstr ":doc:`Elasticsearch </administration-guide/scale/elasticsearch-setup>` 또는 :doc:`AWS OpenSearch </administration-guide/scale/opensearch-setup>`가 활성화된 경우 OKR.BEST는 먼저 이를 사용하려고 시도합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:988
msgid ""
"If Elasticsearch fails or is disabled, Mattermost will attempt to use "
"Bleve search, if enabled. Bleve search has been deprecated in Mattermost "
"v11.0. We recommend using Elasticsearch or OpenSearch for enterprise "
"search capabilities."
msgstr "Elasticsearch가 실패하거나 비활성화된 경우 OKR.BEST는 Bleve 검색이 활성화되어 있으면 이를 사용하려고 시도합니다. Bleve 검색은 OKR.BEST v11.0에서 더 이상 사용되지 않습니다. 엔터프라이즈 검색 기능을 위해 Elasticsearch 또는 OpenSearch를 사용할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:989
msgid ""
"If these fail or are disabled, Mattermost tries to search the database "
"directly, if this is enabled."
msgstr "이들이 실패하거나 비활성화된 경우 OKR.BEST는 데이터베이스 검색이 활성화되어 있으면 데이터베이스를 직접 검색하려고 시도합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:990
msgid ""
"If all of the above methods fail or are disabled, the search results will"
" be empty."
msgstr "위의 모든 방법이 실패하거나 비활성화된 경우 검색 결과가 비어 있게 됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:994
msgid ""
"Disabling this configuration setting in larger deployments may improve "
"server performance in the following areas:"
msgstr "대규모 배포에서 이 구성 설정을 비활성화하면 다음 영역에서 서버 성능이 향상될 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:996
msgid ""
"**Reduced Database Load**: When database search is enabled, every search "
"query executed by users needs to interact with the database, leading to "
"additional load on the database server. By disabling database search, you"
" can avoid these queries, thereby reducing the database load."
msgstr "**데이터베이스 부하 감소**: 데이터베이스 검색이 활성화되면 사용자가 실행하는 모든 검색 쿼리가 데이터베이스와 상호 작용해야 하므로 데이터베이스 서버에 추가 부하가 발생합니다. 데이터베이스 검색을 비활성화하면 이러한 쿼리를 피할 수 있어 데이터베이스 부하가 줄어듭니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:997
msgid ""
"**Improved Response Time**: Database searches can be time-consuming, "
"especially with large datasets. Disabling database search can result in "
"faster response times because the system no longer spends time fetching "
"and processing search results from the database."
msgstr "**응답 시간 개선**: 데이터베이스 검색은 특히 대규모 데이터 세트에서 시간이 많이 걸릴 수 있습니다. 데이터베이스 검색을 비활성화하면 시스템이 더 이상 데이터베이스에서 검색 결과를 가져오고 처리하는 데 시간을 소비하지 않으므로 응답 시간이 빨라질 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:998
msgid ""
"**Offloading Search to Indexing Services**: Disabling database search "
"often means that searches are offloaded to specialized indexing services "
"like Elasticsearch, which are optimized for search operations. These "
"services can provide faster and more efficient search capabilities "
"compared to traditional database searches."
msgstr "**인덱싱 서비스로 검색 오프로드**: 데이터베이스 검색을 비활성화하면 일반적으로 검색이 검색 작업에 최적화된 Elasticsearch와 같은 전문 인덱싱 서비스로 오프로드됩니다. 이러한 서비스는 기존 데이터베이스 검색에 비해 더 빠르고 효율적인 검색 기능을 제공할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:999
msgid ""
"**Lower Resource Consumption**: Running search queries directly against "
"the database can be resource-intensive (using CPU and memory). With "
"database search disabled, these resources can be allocated to other "
"critical functions, improving overall system performance."
msgstr "**리소스 소비 감소**: 데이터베이스에 대해 직접 검색 쿼리를 실행하면 리소스를 많이 사용할 수 있습니다(CPU 및 메모리 사용). 데이터베이스 검색을 비활성화하면 이러한 리소스를 다른 중요한 기능에 할당할 수 있어 전체 시스템 성능이 향상됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1000
msgid ""
"**Enhanced Scalability**: As the number of users and data volume grow, "
"database search can become less efficient. Specialized search services "
"are designed to scale more effectively, enhancing overall system "
"scalability and performance."
msgstr "**확장성 향상**: 사용자 수와 데이터 볼륨이 증가함에 따라 데이터베이스 검색의 효율성이 떨어질 수 있습니다. 전문 검색 서비스는 보다 효과적으로 확장하도록 설계되어 전체 시스템 확장성과 성능을 향상시킵니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1002
msgid ""
"However, the ability to perform database searches in Mattermost is a "
"critical feature for many users, particularly when other search engines "
"aren't enabled. Disabling this feature will result in users seeing an "
"error if they attempt to use the Mattermost Search box. It’s important to"
" balance performance improvements with the needs of your organization and"
" users."
msgstr "그러나 OKR.BEST에서 데이터베이스 검색을 수행하는 기능은 특히 다른 검색 엔진이 활성화되지 않은 경우 많은 사용자에게 중요한 기능입니다. 이 기능을 비활성화하면 사용자가 OKR.BEST 검색 상자를 사용하려고 할 때 오류가 표시됩니다. 성능 개선과 조직 및 사용자의 요구 사항 간의 균형을 맞추는 것이 중요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1005
msgid "Applied schema migrations"
msgstr "적용된 스키마 마이그레이션"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1007
msgid ""
"A list of all migrations that have been applied to the data store based "
"on the version information available in the ``db_migrations`` table. "
"Select **About Mattermost** from the Product |product-list| menu to "
"review the current database schema version applied to your deployment."
msgstr "``db_migrations`` 테이블에서 사용 가능한 버전 정보를 기반으로 데이터 저장소에 적용된 모든 마이그레이션 목록입니다. 배포에 적용된 현재 데이터베이스 스키마 버전을 검토하려면 Product |product-list| 메뉴에서 **About Mattermost**를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1017
msgid "Active search backend"
msgstr "활성 검색 백엔드"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1019
msgid ""
"Read-only display of the currently active backend used for search. Values"
" can include ``none``, ``database``, ``elasticsearch``, or ``bleve``."
msgstr "검색에 사용되는 현재 활성 백엔드의 읽기 전용 표시입니다. 값에는 ``none``, ``database``, ``elasticsearch`` 또는 ``bleve``가 포함될 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1029
msgid "Read replicas"
msgstr "읽기 복제본"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1032
msgid "Specifies the connection strings for the read replica databases."
msgstr "읽기 복제본 데이터베이스에 대한 연결 문자열을 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1033
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > ``DataSourceReplicas`` > ``[]``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``DataSourceReplicas`` > ``[]``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1034
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_DATASOURCEREPLICAS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_DATASOURCEREPLICAS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1039
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1068
msgid ""
"Each database connection string in the array must be in the same form "
"used for the `Data source <#data-source>`__ setting."
msgstr "배열의 각 데이터베이스 연결 문자열은 `데이터 소스 <#data-source>`__ 설정에 사용되는 것과 동일한 형식이어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1040
msgid ""
"Space separate multiple read replicas in the array to allow Mattermost to"
" load balance read queries across multiple database instances. For "
"example, ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_DATASOURCEREPLICAS=dc-1 dc-2``"
msgstr "OKR.BEST가 여러 데이터베이스 인스턴스에서 읽기 쿼리의 부하를 분산할 수 있도록 배열에서 여러 읽기 복제본을 공백으로 구분합니다. 예: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_DATASOURCEREPLICAS=dc-1 dc-2``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1043
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1071
msgid "AWS High Availability RDS cluster deployments"
msgstr "AWS 고가용성 RDS 클러스터 배포"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1045
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1073
msgid ""
"For an AWS High Availability RDS cluster deployment, point this "
"configuration setting directly to the underlying read-only node endpoint "
"within the RDS cluster to circumvent the failover/load balancing that "
"AWS/RDS takes care of (except for the write traffic). Mattermost has its "
"own method of balancing the read-only connections and can also balance "
"those queries to the data source/write+read connection should those nodes"
" fail. See the :ref:`high availablility database configuration "
"<administration-guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-"
"deployment:database configuration>` documentation for details."
msgstr "AWS 고가용성 RDS 클러스터 배포의 경우 AWS/RDS가 처리하는 장애 조치/부하 분산(쓰기 트래픽 제외)을 우회하기 위해 이 구성 설정을 RDS 클러스터 내의 기본 읽기 전용 노드 엔드포인트로 직접 지정합니다. OKR.BEST는 읽기 전용 연결의 부하를 분산하는 자체 방법을 가지고 있으며, 해당 노드가 실패할 경우 이러한 쿼리를 데이터 소스/쓰기+읽기 연결로 분산할 수도 있습니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`고가용성 데이터베이스 구성 <administration-guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-deployment:database configuration>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1057
msgid "Search replicas"
msgstr "검색 복제본"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1060
msgid ""
"Specifies the connection strings for the search replica databases. A "
"search replica is similar to a read replica, but is used only for "
"handling search queries."
msgstr "검색 복제본 데이터베이스에 대한 연결 문자열을 지정합니다. 검색 복제본은 읽기 복제본과 유사하지만 검색 쿼리를 처리하는 데만 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1061
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > ``DataSourceSearchReplicas`` >"
" ``[]``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``DataSourceSearchReplicas`` > ``[]``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1062
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_DATASOURCESEARCHREPLICAS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_DATASOURCESEARCHREPLICAS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1083
msgid "Replica lag settings"
msgstr "복제본 지연 설정"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1089
msgid ""
"String array input specifies a connection string and user-defined SQL "
"queries on the database to measure replica lag for a single replica "
"instance."
msgstr "문자열 배열 입력은 단일 복제본 인스턴스의 복제본 지연을 측정하기 위해 데이터베이스에 대한 연결 문자열과 사용자 정의 SQL 쿼리를 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1093
msgid ""
"These settings monitor absolute lag based on binlog distance/transaction "
"queue length, and the time taken for the replica to catch up."
msgstr "이 설정은 binlog 거리/트랜잭션 큐 길이를 기반으로 한 절대 지연과 복제본이 따라잡는 데 걸리는 시간을 모니터링합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1097
msgid "String array input consists of:"
msgstr "문자열 배열 입력은 다음으로 구성됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1099
msgid ""
"``DataSource``: The database credentials to connect to the database "
"instance."
msgstr "``DataSource``: 데이터베이스 인스턴스에 연결하기 위한 데이터베이스 자격 증명입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1101
msgid ""
"``QueryAbsoluteLag``: A plain SQL query that must return a single row. "
"The first column must be the node value of the Prometheus metric, and the"
" second column must be the value of the lag used to measure absolute lag."
msgstr "``QueryAbsoluteLag``: 단일 행을 반환해야 하는 일반 SQL 쿼리입니다. 첫 번째 열은 Prometheus 메트릭의 노드 값이어야 하며, 두 번째 열은 절대 지연을 측정하는 데 사용되는 지연 값이어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1106
msgid ""
"``QueryTimeLag``: A plain SQL query that must return a single row. The "
"first column must be the node value of the Prometheus metric, and the "
"second column must be the value of the lag used to measure the time lag."
msgstr "``QueryTimeLag``: 단일 행을 반환해야 하는 일반 SQL 쿼리입니다. 첫 번째 열은 Prometheus 메트릭의 노드 값이어야 하며, 두 번째 열은 시간 지연을 측정하는 데 사용되는 지연 값이어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1090
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > ``ReplicaLagSettings`` > ``[]``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``ReplicaLagSettings`` > ``[]``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1091
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_REPLICALAGSETTINGS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_REPLICALAGSETTINGS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1115
msgid ""
"The ``QueryAbsoluteLag`` and ``QueryTimeLag`` queries must return a "
"single row."
msgstr "``QueryAbsoluteLag`` 및 ``QueryTimeLag`` 쿼리는 단일 행을 반환해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1116
msgid ""
"To properly monitor this, you must set up :doc:`performance monitoring "
"</administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-"
"monitoring>` for Mattermost."
msgstr "이를 제대로 모니터링하려면 OKR.BEST에 대해 :doc:`성능 모니터링 </administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring>`을 설정해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1118
msgid ""
"Configure the replica lag metric based on your database type. See the "
"following tabs for details on configuring this for each database type."
msgstr "데이터베이스 유형에 따라 복제본 지연 메트릭을 구성합니다. 각 데이터베이스 유형에 대한 구성 자세한 내용은 다음 탭을 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1122
msgid ""
"Add the configuration highlighted below to your "
"``SqlSettings.ReplicaLagSettings`` array. You only need to add this once "
"because replication statistics for AWS Aurora nodes are visible across "
"all server instances that are members of the cluster. Be sure to change "
"the ``DataSource`` to point to a single node in the group."
msgstr "아래에 강조 표시된 구성을 ``SqlSettings.ReplicaLagSettings`` 배열에 추가합니다. AWS Aurora 노드의 복제 통계는 클러스터의 구성원인 모든 서버 인스턴스에서 볼 수 있으므로 이 작업은 한 번만 추가하면 됩니다. ``DataSource``를 그룹의 단일 노드를 가리키도록 변경해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1124
msgid ""
"For more information on Aurora replication stats, see the `AWS Aurora "
"documentaion "
"<https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/aurora_global_db_instance_status.html>`__."
msgstr "Aurora 복제 통계에 대한 자세한 내용은 `AWS Aurora 문서 <https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/aurora_global_db_instance_status.html>`__를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1126
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1149
msgid "Example"
msgstr "예시"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1145
msgid ""
"Add the configuration highlighted below to your "
"``SqlSettings.ReplicaLagSettings`` array. You only need to add this once "
"because replication statistics for all nodes are shared across all server"
" instances that are members of the MySQL replication group. Be sure to "
"change the ``DataSource`` to point to a single node in the group."
msgstr "아래에 강조 표시된 구성을 ``SqlSettings.ReplicaLagSettings`` 배열에 추가합니다. 모든 노드의 복제 통계는 MySQL 복제 그룹의 구성원인 모든 서버 인스턴스에서 공유되므로 이 작업은 한 번만 추가하면 됩니다. ``DataSource``를 그룹의 단일 노드를 가리키도록 변경해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1147
msgid ""
"For more information on group replication stats, see the `MySQL "
"documentation <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/group-replication-"
"replication-group-member-stats.html>`__."
msgstr "그룹 복제 통계에 대한 자세한 내용은 `MySQL 문서 <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/group-replication-replication-group-member-stats.html>`__를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1168
msgid ""
"Add the configuration highlighted below to your "
"``SqlSettings.ReplicaLagSettings`` array. This query should run against "
"the **primary** node in your cluster, to do this change the "
"``DataSource`` to match the `SqlSettings.DataSource <#data-source>`__ "
"setting you have configured."
msgstr "아래에 강조 표시된 구성을 ``SqlSettings.ReplicaLagSettings`` 배열에 추가합니다. 이 쿼리는 클러스터의 **기본** 노드에 대해 실행해야 하며, 이를 위해 ``DataSource``를 구성한 `SqlSettings.DataSource <#data-source>`__ 설정과 일치하도록 변경합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1170
msgid ""
"For more information on pg_stat_replication, see the `PostgreSQL "
"documentation <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/monitoring-"
"stats.html#MONITORING-PG-STAT-REPLICATION-VIEW>`__."
msgstr "pg_stat_replication에 대한 자세한 내용은 `PostgreSQL 문서 <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/monitoring-stats.html#MONITORING-PG-STAT-REPLICATION-VIEW>`__를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1172
msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**예시:**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1189
msgid ""
"Grant permissions to the database user for ``pg_monitor``. This user "
"should be the same user configured above in the ``DataSource`` string."
msgstr "``pg_monitor``에 대한 권한을 데이터베이스 사용자에게 부여합니다. 이 사용자는 위의 ``DataSource`` 문자열에 구성된 사용자와 동일해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1191
msgid ""
"For more information on roles, see the `PostgreSQL documentation "
"<https://www.postgresql.org/docs/10/default-roles.html>`__."
msgstr "역할에 대한 자세한 내용은 `PostgreSQL 문서 <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/10/default-roles.html>`__를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1198
msgid "Save the config and restart all Mattermost nodes."
msgstr "구성을 저장하고 모든 OKR.BEST 노드를 다시 시작합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1199
msgid ""
"Navigate to your Grafana instance monitoring Mattermost and open the "
"`Mattermost Performance Monitoring v2 "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/15582-mattermost-performance-"
"monitoring-v2/>`_ dashboard."
msgstr "OKR.BEST를 모니터링하는 Grafana 인스턴스로 이동하여 `Mattermost Performance Monitoring v2 <https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/15582-mattermost-performance-monitoring-v2/>`_ 대시보드를 엽니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1200
msgid ""
"The ``QueryTimeLag`` chart is already setup for you utilizing the "
"existing ``Replica Lag`` chart. If using ``QueryAbsoluteLag`` metric "
"clone the ``Replica Lag`` chart and edit the query to use the below "
"absolute lag metrics and modify the title to be ``Replica Lag Absolute``."
msgstr "``QueryTimeLag`` 차트는 기존 ``Replica Lag`` 차트를 활용하여 이미 설정되어 있습니다. ``QueryAbsoluteLag`` 메트릭을 사용하는 경우 ``Replica Lag`` 차트를 복제하고 아래의 절대 지연 메트릭을 사용하도록 쿼리를 편집한 다음 제목을 ``Replica Lag Absolute``로 수정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1206
msgid "A screenshot showing how to clone a chart within Grafana"
msgstr "Grafana 내에서 차트를 복제하는 방법을 보여주는 스크린샷"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1210
msgid ""
"A screenshot showing the specific edits to make to the cloned grafana "
"chart."
msgstr "복제된 grafana 차트에 적용할 특정 편집 내용을 보여주는 스크린샷입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1223
msgid "Replica monitor interval (seconds)"
msgstr "복제본 모니터 간격(초)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1226
msgid ""
"Specifies how frequently unhealthy replicas will be monitored for "
"liveness check. Mattermost will dynamically choose a replica if it's "
"alive."
msgstr "비정상 복제본의 활성 상태 확인을 위해 모니터링하는 빈도를 지정합니다. OKR.BEST는 복제본이 활성 상태이면 동적으로 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1230
msgid "Numerical input. Default is 5 seconds."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 5초입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1227
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``SqlSettings`` > "
"``ReplicaMonitorIntervalSeconds`` > ``5``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SqlSettings`` > ``ReplicaMonitorIntervalSeconds`` > ``5``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1228
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_REPLICAMONITORINTERVALSECONDS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SQLSETTINGS_REPLICAMONITORINTERVALSECONDS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1235
msgid "This configuration setting is applicable to self-hosted deployments only."
msgstr "이 구성 설정은 셀프 호스팅 배포에만 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1240
msgid "Enterprise search"
msgstr "엔터프라이즈 검색"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1245
msgid ""
"Core database search happens in a relational database and is intended for"
" deployments under about 2–3 million posts and file entries. Beyond that "
"scale, enabling enterprise search with Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch is"
" highly recommended for optimum search performance before reaching 3 "
"million posts."
msgstr "핵심 데이터베이스 검색은 관계형 데이터베이스에서 이루어지며 약 2~3백만 개의 게시물 및 파일 항목 미만의 배포를 위한 것입니다. 그 규모를 넘어서면 3백만 게시물에 도달하기 전에 최적의 검색 성능을 위해 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch로 엔터프라이즈 검색을 활성화할 것을 강력히 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1247
msgid ""
"For self-hosted deployments with over 3 million posts, Elasticsearch or "
"AWS OpenSearch is required to avoid significant performance issues, such "
"as timeouts, with :doc:`message searches </end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/search-for-messages>` and :doc:`@mentions </end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/mention-people>`."
msgstr "3백만 개가 넘는 게시물이 있는 셀프 호스팅 배포의 경우 :doc:`메시지 검색 </end-user-guide/collaborate/search-for-messages>` 및 :doc:`@멘션 </end-user-guide/collaborate/mention-people>`에서 시간 초과와 같은 심각한 성능 문제를 피하기 위해 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch가 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1249
msgid ""
"You can configure Mattermost enterprise search by going to **System "
"Console > Environment > Elasticsearch**. The following configuration "
"settings apply to both Elasticsearch and AWS OpenSearch. You can also "
"edit the ``config.json`` file as described in the following tables. "
"Changes to configuration settings in this section require a server "
"restart before taking effect."
msgstr "**System Console > Environment > Elasticsearch**로 이동하여 OKR.BEST 엔터프라이즈 검색을 구성할 수 있습니다. 다음 구성 설정은 Elasticsearch와 AWS OpenSearch 모두에 적용됩니다. 다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집할 수도 있습니다. 이 섹션의 구성 설정을 변경하면 적용되기 전에 서버를 다시 시작해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1262
msgid "Enable Elasticsearch indexing"
msgstr "Elasticsearch 인덱싱 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1265
msgid "Configure Mattermost to index new posts automatically."
msgstr "새 게시물을 자동으로 인덱싱하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1267
msgid "**true**: Indexing of new messages occurs automatically."
msgstr "**true**: 새 메시지의 인덱싱이 자동으로 수행됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1268
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Indexing of new messages is disabled, and new "
"messages aren't indexed."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 새 메시지의 인덱싱이 비활성화되며 새 메시지가 인덱싱되지 않습니다."

