msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_CA``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1331
msgid ""
"Available from Mattermost v7.8. The certificate path should be "
"``/opt/mattermost/data/elasticsearch/`` or "
"``/opt/mattermost/data/opensearch`` and configured in the System Console "
"as ``./elasticsearch/cert.pem`` or ``./opensearch/cert.pem``."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v7.8부터 사용할 수 있습니다. 인증서 경로는 ``/opt/mattermost/data/elasticsearch/`` 또는 ``/opt/mattermost/data/opensearch``여야 하며 관리자 도구에서 ``./elasticsearch/cert.pem`` 또는 ``./opensearch/cert.pem``으로 구성되어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1332
msgid ""
"Can be used in conjunction with basic authentication credentials or can "
