#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1366
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``ClientKey``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``ClientKey``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1367
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_CLIENTKEY``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_CLIENTKEY``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1381
