msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST는 인증서 확인을 요구합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1385
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``SkipTLSVerification`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``SkipTLSVerification`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1386
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_SKIPTLSVERIFICATION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_SKIPTLSVERIFICATION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1400
msgid "Server username"
msgstr "서버 사용자 이름"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1403
