#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1420
msgid ""
"(Optional) The password to authenticate to the Elasticsearch or AWS "
"OpenSearch server."
msgstr "(선택 사항) Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 서버에 인증할 비밀번호입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1421
