#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1451
msgid ""
"Do not enable cluster sniffing when using cloud-hosted search providers "
"such as Amazon OpenSearch Service."
msgstr "Amazon OpenSearch Service와 같은 클라우드 호스팅 검색 공급자를 사용할 때는 클러스터 스니핑을 활성화하지 마세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1445
