msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``Sniff`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1446
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_SNIFF``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_SNIFF``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1455
msgid ""
"Select the **Test Connection** button in the System Console to validate "
"the connection between Mattermost and the Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch"
" server."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Test Connection** 버튼을 선택하여 OKR.BEST와 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 서버 간의 연결을 검증합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1465
msgid "Bulk indexing"
msgstr "대량 인덱싱"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1468
msgid ""
"Configure Mattermost to start a bulk index of all existing posts in the "
"database, from oldest to newest."
msgstr "데이터베이스의 기존 모든 게시물을 가장 오래된 것부터 가장 최근 것까지 대량 인덱싱을 시작하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1475
msgid "Always `purge indexes <#purge-indexes>`__ before bulk indexing."
msgstr "대량 인덱싱 전에 항상 `인덱스를 제거 <#purge-indexes>`__합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1476
msgid ""
"Select the **Index Now** button in the System Console to start a bulk "
"index of all posts, and review all index jobs in progress."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Index Now** 버튼을 선택하여 모든 게시물의 대량 인덱싱을 시작하고 진행 중인 모든 인덱스 작업을 검토합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1477
msgid ""
"Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch is available during indexing, but search "
"results may be incomplete until the indexing job is complete."
msgstr "인덱싱 중에는 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch를 사용할 수 있지만 인덱싱 작업이 완료될 때까지 검색 결과가 불완전할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1478
msgid ""
"If an in-progress indexing job is canceled, the index and search results "
"will be incomplete."
msgstr "진행 중인 인덱싱 작업이 취소되면 인덱스와 검색 결과가 불완전해집니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1488
msgid "Rebuild channels index"
msgstr "채널 인덱스 다시 빌드"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1491
msgid ""
"Purge the channels index adn re-index all channels in the database, from "
"oldest to newest."
msgstr "채널 인덱스를 제거하고 데이터베이스의 모든 채널을 가장 오래된 것부터 가장 최근 것까지 다시 인덱싱합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1496
msgid ""
"Select the **Rebuild Channels Index** button in the System Console to "
"purge the channels index. Ensure no other indexing jobs are in progress "
"via the **Bulk Indexing** table before starting this process. During "
"indexing, channel auto-complete is available, but search results may be "
"incomplete until the indexing job is complete."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Rebuild Channels Index** 버튼을 선택하여 채널 인덱스를 제거합니다. 이 프로세스를 시작하기 전에 **Bulk Indexing** 표를 통해 진행 중인 다른 인덱싱 작업이 없는지 확인합니다. 인덱싱 중에는 채널 자동 완성을 사용할 수 있지만 인덱싱 작업이 완료될 때까지 검색 결과가 불완전할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1506
msgid "Purge indexes"
msgstr "인덱스 제거"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1509
msgid "Purge the entire Elasticsearch index."
msgstr "전체 Elasticsearch 인덱스를 제거합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1514
msgid ""
"Select the **Purge Indexes** button in the System Console to purge the "
"index. After purging the index, create a new index by selecting the "
"**Index Now** button."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Purge Indexes** 버튼을 선택하여 인덱스를 제거합니다. 인덱스를 제거한 후 **Index Now** 버튼을 선택하여 새 인덱스를 생성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1524
msgid "Indexes to skip while purging"
msgstr "제거 중 건너뛸 인덱스"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1527
msgid ""
"Specify index names to ignore while purging indexes. Separate multiple "
"index names with commas."
msgstr "인덱스를 제거하는 동안 무시할 인덱스 이름을 지정합니다. 여러 인덱스 이름은 쉼표로 구분합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1530
msgid "Use an asterisk (*) to match a sequence of index name characters."
msgstr "별표(*)를 사용하여 인덱스 이름 문자 시퀀스를 일치시킵니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1528
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``IgnoredPurgeIndexes``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``IgnoredPurgeIndexes``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1529
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_IGNOREDPURGEINDEXES``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_IGNOREDPURGEINDEXES``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1545
msgid "Enable Elasticsearch for search queries"
msgstr "검색 쿼리에 Elasticsearch 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1548
msgid ""
"Configure Mattermost to use Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch for all "
"search queries using the latest index."
msgstr "최신 인덱스를 사용하는 모든 검색 쿼리에 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch를 사용하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1551
msgid ""
"**true**: Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch is used for all search queries "
"using the latest index. Search results may be incomplete until a bulk "
"index of the existing message database is completed."
msgstr "**true**: 최신 인덱스를 사용하는 모든 검색 쿼리에 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch가 사용됩니다. 기존 메시지 데이터베이스의 대량 인덱싱이 완료될 때까지 검색 결과가 불완전할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1555
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Database search is used for search queries."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 검색 쿼리에 데이터베이스 검색이 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1549
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``EnableSearching`` "
"> ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``EnableSearching`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1550
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_ENABLESEARCHING``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_ENABLESEARCHING``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1572
msgid "Enable Elasticsearch for autocomplete queries"
msgstr "자동 완성 쿼리에 Elasticsearch 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1575
msgid ""
"Configure Mattermost to use Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch for all "
"autocompletion queries on users and channels using the latest index."
msgstr "최신 인덱스를 사용하는 사용자 및 채널에 대한 모든 자동 완성 쿼리에 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch를 사용하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1579
msgid ""
"**true**: Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch will be used for all "
"autocompletion queries on users and channels using the latest index."
msgstr "**true**: 최신 인덱스를 사용하는 사용자 및 채널에 대한 모든 자동 완성 쿼리에 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch가 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1582
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Database autocomplete is used."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 데이터베이스 자동 완성이 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1576
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``EnableAutocomplete`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``EnableAutocomplete`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1577
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_ENABLEAUTOCOMPLETE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_ENABLEAUTOCOMPLETE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1585
msgid ""
"Autocompletion results may be incomplete until a bulk index of the "
"existing users and channels database is finished."
msgstr "기존 사용자 및 채널 데이터베이스의 대량 인덱싱이 완료될 때까지 자동 완성 결과가 불완전할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1598
msgid "Allow searching public channels without membership"
msgstr "멤버십 없이 공개 채널 검색 허용"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1601
msgid ""
"Allow users to search for messages in public channels they have not "
"joined."
msgstr "사용자가 참여하지 않은 공개 채널에서 메시지를 검색할 수 있도록 허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1604
msgid ""
"When enabled for the first time, existing posts are updated in the "
"background with channel type information. This backfill process is "
"throttled to ~10,000 posts per second to avoid impacting search "
"performance."
msgstr "처음 활성화하면 기존 게시물이 채널 유형 정보로 백그라운드에서 업데이트됩니다. 이 백필 프로세스는 검색 성능에 영향을 주지 않도록 초당 약 10,000개의 게시물로 제한됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1609
msgid ""
"**true**: Users can find messages in public channels they haven't joined,"
" scoped to teams they belong to."
msgstr "**true**: 사용자가 참여하지 않은 공개 채널에서 메시지를 찾을 수 있으며, 사용자가 속한 팀으로 범위가 제한됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1611
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Users can only search messages in channels they "
"are a member of."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 사용자는 자신이 멤버인 채널에서만 메시지를 검색할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1602
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``EnableSearchPublicChannelsWithoutMembership`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``EnableSearchPublicChannelsWithoutMembership`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1604
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_ENABLESEARCHPUBLICCHANNELSWITHOUTMEMBERSHIP``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_ENABLESEARCHPUBLICCHANNELSWITHOUTMEMBERSHIP``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1617
msgid ""
"This setting has no effect when :ref:`Compliance Mode <administration-"
"guide/configure/compliance-configuration-settings:enable compliance "
"reporting>` is enabled. When Compliance Mode is active, search results "
"are always restricted to channels the user is a member of."
msgstr ":ref:`규정 준수 모드 <administration-guide/configure/compliance-configuration-settings:enable compliance reporting>`가 활성화된 경우 이 설정은 적용되지 않습니다. 규정 준수 모드가 활성화되면 검색 결과는 항상 사용자가 멤버인 채널로 제한됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1627
msgid "Post index replicas"
msgstr "게시물 인덱스 복제본"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1630
msgid "The number of replicas to use for each post index."
msgstr "각 게시물 인덱스에 사용할 복제본 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1632
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1654
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1674
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1694
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1710
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1730
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **1**."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **1**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1631
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``PostIndexReplicas`` > ``1``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``PostIndexReplicas`` > ``1``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1632
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_POSTINDEXREPLICAS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_POSTINDEXREPLICAS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1637
msgid ""
"If this setting is changed, the changed configuration only applies to "
"newly-created indexes. To apply the change to existing indexes, purge and"
" rebuild the index after changing this setting."
msgstr "이 설정을 변경하면 변경된 구성은 새로 생성된 인덱스에만 적용됩니다. 기존 인덱스에 변경 사항을 적용하려면 이 설정을 변경한 후 인덱스를 제거하고 다시 빌드합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1638
msgid ""
"If there are ``n`` data nodes, the number of replicas per shard for each "
"index should be ``n-1``."
msgstr "``n``개의 데이터 노드가 있는 경우 각 인덱스의 샤드당 복제본 수는 ``n-1``이어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1639
msgid ""
"If the number of nodes in an Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch cluster "
"changes, this configuration setting, as well as `Channel Index Replicas "
"<#channel-index-replicas>`__ and `User Index Replicas <#user-index-"
"replicas>`__ must also be updated accordingly."
msgstr "Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 클러스터의 노드 수가 변경되면 이 구성 설정과 함께 `채널 인덱스 복제본 <#channel-index-replicas>`__ 및 `사용자 인덱스 복제본 <#user-index-replicas>`__도 그에 따라 업데이트해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1649
msgid "Post index shards"
msgstr "게시물 인덱스 샤드"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1652
msgid "The number of shards to use for each post index."
msgstr "각 게시물 인덱스에 사용할 샤드 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1653
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``PostIndexShards`` "
"> ``1``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``PostIndexShards`` > ``1``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1654
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_POSTINDEXSHARDS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_POSTINDEXSHARDS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1659
msgid ""
"If this configuration setting is changed, the changed configuration only "
"applies to newly-created indexes. To apply the change to existing "
"indexes, purge and rebuild the index after changing this setting."
msgstr "이 구성 설정을 변경하면 변경된 구성은 새로 생성된 인덱스에만 적용됩니다. 기존 인덱스에 변경 사항을 적용하려면 이 설정을 변경한 후 인덱스를 제거하고 다시 빌드합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1669
msgid "Channel index replicas"
msgstr "채널 인덱스 복제본"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1672
msgid "The number of replicas to use for each channel index."
msgstr "각 채널 인덱스에 사용할 복제본 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1673
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``ChannelIndexReplicas`` > ``1``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``ChannelIndexReplicas`` > ``1``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1674
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_CHANNELINDEXREPLICAS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_CHANNELINDEXREPLICAS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1679
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1715
msgid ""
"If there are ``n`` data nodes, the number of replicas per shard for each "
"index should be ``n-1``. If the number of nodes in an Elasticsearch or "
"AWS OpenSearch cluster changes, this configuration setting, as well as "
"`Post Index Replicas <#post-index-shards>`__ and `User Index Replicas "
"<#user-index-replicas>`__ must also be updated accordingly."
msgstr "``n``개의 데이터 노드가 있는 경우 각 인덱스의 샤드당 복제본 수는 ``n-1``이어야 합니다. Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 클러스터의 노드 수가 변경되면 이 구성 설정과 함께 `게시물 인덱스 복제본 <#post-index-shards>`__ 및 `사용자 인덱스 복제본 <#user-index-replicas>`__도 그에 따라 업데이트해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1689
msgid "Channel index shards"
msgstr "채널 인덱스 샤드"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1692
msgid "The number of shards to use for each channel index."
msgstr "각 채널 인덱스에 사용할 샤드 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1693
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``ChannelIndexShards`` > ``1``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``ChannelIndexShards`` > ``1``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1694
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_CHANNELINDEXSHARDS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_CHANNELINDEXSHARDS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1705
msgid "User index replicas"
msgstr "사용자 인덱스 복제본"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1708
msgid "The number of replicas to use for each user index."
msgstr "각 사용자 인덱스에 사용할 복제본 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1709
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``UserIndexReplicas`` > ``1``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``UserIndexReplicas`` > ``1``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1710
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_USERINDEXREPLICAS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_USERINDEXREPLICAS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1725
msgid "User index shards"
msgstr "사용자 인덱스 샤드"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1728
msgid "The number of shards to use for each user index."
msgstr "각 사용자 인덱스에 사용할 샤드 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1729
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``UserIndexShards`` "
"> ``1``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``UserIndexShards`` > ``1``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1730
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_USERINDEXSHARDS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_USERINDEXSHARDS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1741
msgid "Aggregate search indexes"
msgstr "검색 인덱스 집계"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1744
msgid ""
"Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch indexes older than the age specified by "
"this setting, in days, will be aggregated during the daily scheduled job."
msgstr "이 설정으로 지정된 기간(일)보다 오래된 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 인덱스는 매일 예약된 작업 중에 집계됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1748
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **365** days."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **365**일입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1745
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``AggregatePostsAfterDays`` > ``365``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``AggregatePostsAfterDays`` > ``365``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1746
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_AGGREGATEPOSTSAFTERDAYS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_AGGREGATEPOSTSAFTERDAYS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1753
msgid ""
"If you’re using :doc:`data retention </administration-guide/comply/data-"
"retention-policy>` and :doc:`enterprise search </administration-"
"guide/scale/enterprise-search>`, configure this with a value greater than"
" your data retention policy."
msgstr ":doc:`데이터 보존 </administration-guide/comply/data-retention-policy>` 및 :doc:`엔터프라이즈 검색 </administration-guide/scale/enterprise-search>`을 사용하는 경우 데이터 보존 정책보다 큰 값으로 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1763
msgid "Post aggregator start time"
msgstr "게시물 집계기 시작 시간"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1766
msgid "The start time of the daily scheduled aggregator job."
msgstr "매일 예약된 집계기 작업의 시작 시간입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1768
msgid ""
"Must be a 24-hour time stamp in the form ``HH:MM`` based on the local "
"time of the server."
msgstr "서버의 로컬 시간을 기준으로 한 ``HH:MM`` 형식의 24시간 타임스탬프여야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1771
msgid "Default is **03:00** (3 AM)"
msgstr "기본값은 **03:00**(오전 3시)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1767
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``PostsAggregatorJobStartTime`` > ``\"03:00\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``PostsAggregatorJobStartTime`` > ``\"03:00\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1768
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_POSTSAGGREGATORJOBSTARTTIME``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_POSTSAGGREGATORJOBSTARTTIME``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1782
msgid "Index prefix"
msgstr "인덱스 접두사"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1785
msgid "The prefix added to the Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch index name."
msgstr "Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 인덱스 이름에 추가되는 접두사입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1786
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``IndexPrefix``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``IndexPrefix``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1787
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_INDEXPREFIX``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_INDEXPREFIX``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1792
msgid ""
"When this setting is used, all Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch indexes "
"created by Mattermost are given this prefix. You can set different "
"prefixes so that multiple Mattermost deployments can share an "
"Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch cluster without the index names "
"colliding."
msgstr "이 설정을 사용하면 OKR.BEST에서 생성된 모든 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 인덱스에 이 접두사가 부여됩니다. 여러 OKR.BEST 배포가 인덱스 이름 충돌 없이 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 클러스터를 공유할 수 있도록 서로 다른 접두사를 설정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1802
msgid "Global search prefix"
msgstr "전역 검색 접두사"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1805
msgid ""
"Enable global search across multiple Elasticsearch indices with the same "
"`index prefix <#index-prefix>`__."
msgstr "동일한 `인덱스 접두사 <#index-prefix>`__를 가진 여러 Elasticsearch 인덱스에서 전역 검색을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1808
msgid ""
"This is helpful for setups with multiple data centers where Elasticsearch"
" instances share data using cross-cluster replication. It allows for "
"easier and unified searching across distributed indices."
msgstr "이는 Elasticsearch 인스턴스가 교차 클러스터 복제를 사용하여 데이터를 공유하는 여러 데이터 센터가 있는 설정에 유용합니다. 분산된 인덱스에서 더 쉽고 통합된 검색을 가능하게 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1813
msgid "Value must be a prefix of ``IndexPrefix``."
msgstr "값은 ``IndexPrefix``의 접두사여야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1806
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``GlobalSearchPrefix``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``GlobalSearchPrefix``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1807
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_GLOBALSEARCHPREFIX``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_GLOBALSEARCHPREFIX``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1824
msgid "Live indexing batch size"
msgstr "실시간 인덱싱 배치 크기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1827
msgid ""
"The number of new posts needed before those posts are added to the "
"Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch index. Once added to the index, the post "
"becomes searchable."
msgstr "해당 게시물이 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 인덱스에 추가되기 전에 필요한 새 게시물 수입니다. 인덱스에 추가되면 게시물을 검색할 수 있게 됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1831
msgid ""
"On servers with more than 1 post per second, we suggest setting this "
"value to the average number of  posts over a 20 second period of time."
msgstr "초당 1개 이상의 게시물이 있는 서버에서는 이 값을 20초 동안의 평균 게시물 수로 설정할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1835
msgid ""
"Numerical input. Default is **1**. Every post is indexed synchronously as"
" they are created."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **1**입니다. 모든 게시물이 생성될 때 동기적으로 인덱싱됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1828
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``LiveIndexingBatchSize`` > ``1``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``LiveIndexingBatchSize`` > ``1``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1829
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_LIVEINDEXINGBATCHSIZE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_LIVEINDEXINGBATCHSIZE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1841
msgid ""
"It may be necessary to increase this value to avoid hitting the rate "
"limit or resource limit of your Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch cluster "
"on installs handling more than 1 post per second."
msgstr "초당 1개 이상의 게시물을 처리하는 설치에서 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 클러스터의 속도 제한이나 리소스 제한에 도달하지 않도록 이 값을 늘려야 할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1843
msgid "**What exactly happens when I increase this value?**"
msgstr "**이 값을 늘리면 정확히 어떤 일이 발생합니까?**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1845
msgid ""
"The primary impact is that a post will be indexed into Elasticsearch or "
"AWS OpenSearch after the threshold of posts is met, which then makes the "
"posts searchable within Mattermost. So, if you set this based on "
"recommendations for larger servers, and you make a post, you cannot find "
"it via search for ~10–20 seconds, on average. Realistically, no users "
"should see or feel this impact due to the limited number of users who are"
" actively **searching** for a post this quickly. You can set this value "
"to a lower or higher average depending on your Elasticsearch or AWS "
"OpenSearch server specifications."
msgstr "주요 영향은 게시물 임계값이 충족된 후 게시물이 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch에 인덱싱되어 OKR.BEST 내에서 게시물을 검색할 수 있게 된다는 것입니다. 따라서 대규모 서버에 대한 권장 사항을 기반으로 이를 설정하고 게시물을 작성하면 평균적으로 약 10~20초 동안 검색을 통해 찾을 수 없습니다. 현실적으로 게시물을 이렇게 빨리 적극적으로 **검색**하는 사용자가 제한되어 있기 때문에 이 영향을 보거나 느끼는 사용자는 없을 것입니다. Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 서버 사양에 따라 이 값을 더 낮거나 높은 평균으로 설정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1847
msgid ""
"During busy periods, this delay will be faster as more traffic is "
"occurring, causing more posts and a quicker time to hit the index number."
" During slower periods, expect the reverse."
msgstr "바쁜 기간에는 더 많은 트래픽이 발생하여 게시물이 늘어나고 인덱스 수에 더 빨리 도달하므로 이 지연이 더 짧아집니다. 한산한 기간에는 그 반대를 예상하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1849
msgid "**How to find the right number for your server**"
msgstr "**서버에 적합한 숫자를 찾는 방법**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1851
msgid ""
"You must understand how many posts your server makes every minute. Run "
"the query below to calculate your server's average posts per minute."
msgstr "서버가 매분 얼마나 많은 게시물을 작성하는지 이해해야 합니다. 아래 쿼리를 실행하여 서버의 분당 평균 게시물 수를 계산합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1853
msgid ""
"Note that this query can be heavy, so we recommend that you run it during"
" non-peak hours. Additionally, you can adjust the ``WHERE`` clause to see"
" the posts per minute over a different time period. Right now "
"``31536000000`` represents the number of milliseconds in a year."
msgstr "이 쿼리는 무거울 수 있으므로 피크 시간이 아닌 시간에 실행할 것을 권장합니다. 또한 ``WHERE`` 절을 조정하여 다른 기간 동안의 분당 게시물 수를 볼 수 있습니다. 현재 ``31536000000``은 1년의 밀리초 수를 나타냅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1869
msgid ""
"Decide the acceptable index window for your environment, and divide your "
"average posts per minute by that. We suggest 10-20 seconds. Assuming you "
"have ``600`` posts per minute on average, and you want to index every 20 "
"seconds (``60 seconds / 20 seconds = 3```) you would calculate ``600 / "
"3`` to come to the number ``200``. After 200 posts, Mattermost will index"
" the posts into Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch. So, on average, there "
"would be a 20-second delay in searchability."
msgstr "환경에 허용 가능한 인덱스 윈도우를 결정하고 분당 평균 게시물 수를 그 값으로 나눕니다. 10~20초를 권장합니다. 분당 평균 ``600``개의 게시물이 있고 20초마다 인덱싱하려는 경우(``60 seconds / 20 seconds = 3```) ``600 / 3``을 계산하여 ``200``이라는 숫자를 얻습니다. 게시물 200개 후에 OKR.BEST는 게시물을 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch에 인덱싱합니다. 따라서 평균적으로 검색 가능성에 20초의 지연이 발생합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1871
msgid ""
"Edit the ``config.json`` or run mmctl to modify the "
"``LiveIndexingBatchSize`` setting"
msgstr "``config.json``을 편집하거나 mmctl을 실행하여 ``LiveIndexingBatchSize`` 설정을 수정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1873
msgid "**In the ``config.json``**"
msgstr "**``config.json``에서**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1883
msgid "**Via mmctl**"
msgstr "**mmctl을 통해**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1889
msgid "**Via an environment variable**"
msgstr "**환경 변수를 통해**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1895
msgid "Restart the Mattermost server."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 서버를 다시 시작합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1905
msgid "Batch size"
msgstr "배치 크기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1908
msgid "The number of posts for a single batch during a bulk indexing job."
msgstr "대량 인덱싱 작업 중 단일 배치의 게시물 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1911
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **10000**."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **10000**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1909
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``BatchSize`` > "
"``10000``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``BatchSize`` > ``10000``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1910
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_BATCHSIZE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_BATCHSIZE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1922
msgid "Request timeout"
msgstr "요청 시간 초과"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1925
msgid "The timeout, in seconds, for Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch calls."
msgstr "Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 호출에 대한 시간 초과(초)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1928
msgid "Numerical input in seconds. Default is **30** seconds."
msgstr "초 단위 숫자 입력. 기본값은 **30**초입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1926
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``RequestTimeoutSeconds`` > ``30``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``RequestTimeoutSeconds`` > ``30``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1927
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_REQUESTTIMEOUTSECONDS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_REQUESTTIMEOUTSECONDS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1943
msgid "Trace"
msgstr "추적"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1946
msgid "Options for printing Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch trace errors."
msgstr "Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 추적 오류를 출력하기 위한 옵션입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1948
msgid ""
"**error**: Creates the error trace when initializing the Elasticsearch or"
" AWS OpenSearch client and prints any template creation or search query "
"that returns an error as part of the error message."
msgstr "**error**: Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 클라이언트를 초기화할 때 오류 추적을 생성하고 오류를 반환하는 모든 템플릿 생성 또는 검색 쿼리를 오류 메시지의 일부로 출력합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1952
msgid ""
"**all**: Creates the three traces (error, trace and info) for the driver "
"and doesn’t print the queries because they will be part of the trace log "
"level of the driver."
msgstr "**all**: 드라이버에 대한 세 가지 추적(error, trace, info)을 생성하며, 쿼리는 드라이버의 추적 로그 수준의 일부가 되므로 출력하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1955
msgid "**not specified**: **(Default)** No error trace is created."
msgstr "**not specified**: **(기본값)** 오류 추적이 생성되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1947
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``Trace``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``Trace``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1948
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_TRACE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_TRACE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1969
msgid "Enable CJK analyzers"
msgstr "CJK 분석기 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1972
msgid ""
"When enabled, Mattermost uses language-specific analyzer plugins to "
"improve search results for Korean, Japanese, and Chinese content. The "
"required analyzer plugins must be installed on the Elasticsearch or AWS "
"OpenSearch server before enabling this setting."
msgstr "활성화하면 OKR.BEST는 언어별 분석기 플러그인을 사용하여 한국어, 일본어, 중국어 콘텐츠에 대한 검색 결과를 개선합니다. 이 설정을 활성화하기 전에 필요한 분석기 플러그인을 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 서버에 설치해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1978
msgid "Supported plugins:"
msgstr "지원되는 플러그인:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1980
msgid "``analysis-nori`` (Korean)"
msgstr "``analysis-nori`` (한국어)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1981
msgid "``analysis-kuromoji`` (Japanese)"
msgstr "``analysis-kuromoji`` (일본어)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1982
msgid "``analysis-smartcn`` (Chinese)"
msgstr "``analysis-smartcn`` (중국어)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1984
msgid "**true**: CJK language-specific analyzers are enabled."
msgstr "**true**: CJK 언어별 분석기가 활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1985
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Standard analyzers are used."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 표준 분석기가 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1973
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > "
"``EnableCJKAnalyzers`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ElasticsearchSettings`` > ``EnableCJKAnalyzers`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1974
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_ENABLECJKANALYZERS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_ELASTICSEARCHSETTINGS_ENABLECJKANALYZERS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1990
msgid ""
"Available from Mattermost v11.6. The required analyzer plugins should be "
"installed on the Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch server before enabling "
"this setting for full analysis support. If no plugin is detected, a "
"warning will be logged. See the :doc:`Elasticsearch setup "
"</administration-guide/scale/elasticsearch-setup>` and :doc:`AWS "
"OpenSearch setup </administration-guide/scale/opensearch-setup>` "
"documentation for plugin installation instructions."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v11.6부터 사용할 수 있습니다. 완전한 분석 지원을 위해 이 설정을 활성화하기 전에 필요한 분석기 플러그인을 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch 서버에 설치해야 합니다. 플러그인이 감지되지 않으면 경고가 로깅됩니다. 플러그인 설치 지침은 :doc:`Elasticsearch 설정 </administration-guide/scale/elasticsearch-setup>` 및 :doc:`AWS OpenSearch 설정 </administration-guide/scale/opensearch-setup>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1992
msgid ""
"If you enable this setting on a server that was previously running "
"Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch, you must purge and rebuild the search "
"indexes for existing content to be properly searchable with the new "
"analyzers. See the :doc:`Elasticsearch setup </administration-guide/scale"
"/elasticsearch-setup>` documentation for instructions on purging and "
"rebuilding indexes."
msgstr "이전에 Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch를 실행하던 서버에서 이 설정을 활성화하는 경우 기존 콘텐츠가 새 분석기로 제대로 검색될 수 있도록 검색 인덱스를 제거하고 다시 빌드해야 합니다. 인덱스 제거 및 다시 빌드에 대한 지침은 :doc:`Elasticsearch 설정 </administration-guide/scale/elasticsearch-setup>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1997
msgid "File storage"
msgstr "파일 저장소"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1999
msgid ""
"With self-hosted deployments, you can configure file storage settings by "
"going to **System Console > Environment > File Storage**, or by editing "
"the ``config.json`` file as described in the following tables."
msgstr "셀프 호스팅 배포에서는 **System Console > Environment > File Storage**로 이동하거나 다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집하여 파일 저장소 설정을 구성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2003
msgid ""
"Mattermost currently supports storing files on the local filesystem and "
"Amazon S3 or S3-compatible containers. We have tested Mattermost with "
"`Digital Ocean Spaces "
"<https://docs.digitalocean.com/products/spaces/>`__, but not all "
"S3-compatible containers on the market. If you are looking to use other "
"S3-compatible containers, we recommend completing your own testing. You "
"can also use local storage or a network drive using NFS."
msgstr "OKR.BEST는 현재 로컬 파일 시스템과 Amazon S3 또는 S3 호환 컨테이너에 파일을 저장하는 것을 지원합니다. `Digital Ocean Spaces <https://docs.digitalocean.com/products/spaces/>`__로 OKR.BEST를 테스트했지만 시장의 모든 S3 호환 컨테이너를 테스트하지는 않았습니다. 다른 S3 호환 컨테이너를 사용하려는 경우 직접 테스트를 완료할 것을 권장합니다. 로컬 저장소 또는 NFS를 사용하는 네트워크 드라이브를 사용할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2016
msgid "File storage system"
msgstr "파일 저장소 시스템"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2019
msgid ""
"The type of file storage system used. Can be either Local File System or "
"Amazon S3."
msgstr "사용되는 파일 저장소 시스템의 유형입니다. 로컬 파일 시스템 또는 Amazon S3일 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2022
msgid ""
"**local**: **(Default)** Files and images are stored in the specified "
"local file directory."
msgstr "**local**: **(기본값)** 파일과 이미지가 지정된 로컬 파일 디렉토리에 저장됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2024
msgid ""
"**amazons3**: Files and images are stored on Amazon S3 based on the "
"access key, bucket, and region fields provided. The driver is compatible "
"with other S3-compatible services, such as Digital Ocean Spaces."
msgstr "**amazons3**: 제공된 액세스 키, 버킷, 리전 필드를 기반으로 파일과 이미지가 Amazon S3에 저장됩니다. 이 드라이버는 Digital Ocean Spaces와 같은 다른 S3 호환 서비스와 호환됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2019
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2041
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2063
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2093
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2131
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2160
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2193
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2215
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2235
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2256
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2274
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2319
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2344
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2369
msgid "System Config path: **Environment > File Storage**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Environment > File Storage**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2020
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``DriverName`` > ``\"local\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``DriverName`` > ``\"local\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2021
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_DRIVERNAME``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_DRIVERNAME``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2038
msgid "Local storage directory"
msgstr "로컬 저장소 디렉토리"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2041
msgid ""
"The local directory to which files are written when the **File storage "
"system** is set to **local**. Can be any directory writable by the user "
"Mattermost is running as, and is relative to the directory where "
"Mattermost is installed."
msgstr "**File storage system**이 **local**로 설정된 경우 파일이 기록되는 로컬 디렉토리입니다. OKR.BEST가 실행되는 사용자가 쓸 수 있는 모든 디렉토리일 수 있으며, OKR.BEST가 설치된 디렉토리에 대한 상대 경로입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2047
msgid "Defaults to **./data/**."
msgstr "기본값은 **./data/**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2042
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``Directory``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``Directory``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2043
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_DIRECTORY``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_DIRECTORY``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2050
msgid ""
"When **File storage system** is set to **amazons3**, this setting has no "
"effect."
msgstr "**File storage system**이 **amazons3**로 설정된 경우 이 설정은 적용되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2060
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3696
msgid "Maximum file size"
msgstr "최대 파일 크기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2063
msgid ""
"The maximum file size for message attachments and plugin uploads. This "
"value must be specified in mebibytes in the System Console, and in bytes "
"in the ``config.json`` file."
msgstr "메시지 첨부 파일 및 플러그인 업로드의 최대 파일 크기입니다. 이 값은 관리자 도구에서는 메비바이트 단위로, ``config.json`` 파일에서는 바이트 단위로 지정해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2067
msgid "The default is ``104857600`` bytes (**100** mebibytes)."
msgstr "기본값은 ``104857600``바이트(**100**메비바이트)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2064
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``MaxFileSize`` > "
"``104857600``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``MaxFileSize`` > ``104857600``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2065
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_MAXFILESIZE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_MAXFILESIZE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2072
msgid ""
"Verify server memory can support your setting choice. Large file sizes "
"increase the risk of server crashes and failed uploads due to network "
"disruptions."
msgstr "서버 메모리가 설정 선택을 지원할 수 있는지 확인합니다. 큰 파일 크기는 네트워크 중단으로 인한 서버 충돌 및 업로드 실패의 위험을 높입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2073
msgid ""
"When :ref:`uploading plugin files <administration-guide/configure"
"/plugins-configuration-settings:upload plugin>`, a ``Received invalid "
"response from the server`` error typically indicates that ``MaxFileSize``"
" isn't large enough to support the plugin file upload, and/or that proxy "
"settings may not be sufficient."
msgstr ":ref:`플러그인 파일을 업로드 <administration-guide/configure/plugins-configuration-settings:upload plugin>`할 때 ``Received invalid response from the server`` 오류는 일반적으로 ``MaxFileSize``가 플러그인 파일 업로드를 지원할 만큼 크지 않거나 프록시 설정이 충분하지 않음을 나타냅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2074
msgid ""
"If you use a proxy or load balancer in front of Mattermost, the following"
" proxy settings must be adjusted accordingly:"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 앞에 프록시 또는 로드 밸런서를 사용하는 경우 다음 프록시 설정을 그에 따라 조정해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2076
msgid "For NGINX, use ``client_max_body_size``."
msgstr "NGINX의 경우 ``client_max_body_size``를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2077
msgid "For Apache, use ``LimitRequestBody``."
msgstr "Apache의 경우 ``LimitRequestBody``를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2090
msgid "Enable document search by content"
msgstr "콘텐츠별 문서 검색 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2093
msgid "Enable users to search the contents of documents attached to messages."
msgstr "사용자가 메시지에 첨부된 문서의 콘텐츠를 검색할 수 있도록 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2096
msgid "**true**: **(Default)** Documents are searchable by their content."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 문서를 콘텐츠로 검색할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2098
msgid ""
"**false**: Documents aren’t searchable by their content. When document "
"content search is disabled, users can search for files by file name only."
msgstr "**false**: 문서를 콘텐츠로 검색할 수 없습니다. 문서 콘텐츠 검색이 비활성화되면 사용자는 파일 이름으로만 파일을 검색할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2094
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``ExtractContent`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``ExtractContent`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2095
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_EXTRACTCONTENT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_EXTRACTCONTENT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2105
msgid ""
"Enabling document search by content is required when extracting content "
"from files. Both Mattermost :doc:`file search </end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/search-for-messages>` and :doc:`Mattermost Agents "
"</end-user-guide/agents>` can access files and their content, when "
"enabled with the necessary dependencies. Document content search results "
"for files shared before upgrading to Mattermost Server v5.35 may be "
"incomplete until an extraction command is executed using the :ref:`mmctl "
"<administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl extract>`. If "
"this command is not run, users can search older files based on file name "
"only."
msgstr "파일에서 콘텐츠를 추출할 때 콘텐츠별 문서 검색을 활성화해야 합니다. OKR.BEST :doc:`파일 검색 </end-user-guide/collaborate/search-for-messages>`과 :doc:`Mattermost Agents </end-user-guide/agents>` 모두 필요한 종속성과 함께 활성화하면 파일 및 해당 콘텐츠에 액세스할 수 있습니다. OKR.BEST 서버 v5.35로 업그레이드하기 전에 공유된 파일의 문서 콘텐츠 검색 결과는 :ref:`mmctl <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl extract>`을 사용하여 추출 명령을 실행할 때까지 불완전할 수 있습니다. 이 명령을 실행하지 않으면 사용자는 파일 이름을 기반으로만 오래된 파일을 검색할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2107
msgid ""
"You can optionally install the following `dependencies "
"<https://github.com/sajari/docconv#dependencies>`__ to extend content "
"searching support in Mattermost to include file formats beyond PDF, DOCX,"
" and ODT, such as DOC, RTF, XML, and HTML:"
msgstr "OKR.BEST의 콘텐츠 검색 지원을 PDF, DOCX, ODT를 넘어 DOC, RTF, XML, HTML과 같은 파일 형식을 포함하도록 확장하기 위해 선택적으로 다음 `종속성 <https://github.com/sajari/docconv#dependencies>`__을 설치할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2109
msgid "**tidy**: Used to search the contents of HTML documents."
msgstr "**tidy**: HTML 문서의 콘텐츠를 검색하는 데 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2110
msgid "**wv**: Used to search the contents of DOC documents."
msgstr "**wv**: DOC 문서의 콘텐츠를 검색하는 데 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2111
msgid ""
"**poppler-utils**: Used to significantly improve server performance when "
"extracting the contents of PDF documents."
msgstr "**poppler-utils**: PDF 문서의 콘텐츠를 추출할 때 서버 성능을 크게 향상시키는 데 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2112
msgid "**unrtf**: Used to search the contents of RTF documents."
msgstr "**unrtf**: RTF 문서의 콘텐츠를 검색하는 데 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2113
msgid ""
"**JusText**: Used to search HTML documents. See the `JusText Python "
"package <https://pypi.org/project/jusText/>`__ for deployment "
"information."
msgstr "**JusText**: HTML 문서를 검색하는 데 사용됩니다. 배포 정보는 `JusText Python 패키지 <https://pypi.org/project/jusText/>`__를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2115
msgid ""
"If you choose not to install these dependencies, you’ll see log entries "
"for documents that couldn’t be extracted. Any documents that can’t be "
"extracted are skipped and logged so that content extraction can proceed."
msgstr "이러한 종속성을 설치하지 않기로 선택하면 추출할 수 없는 문서에 대한 로그 항목이 표시됩니다. 추출할 수 없는 문서는 건너뛰고 로깅되어 콘텐츠 추출이 진행될 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2128
msgid "Enable searching content of documents within ZIP files"
msgstr "ZIP 파일 내 문서 콘텐츠 검색 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2131
msgid ""
"Enables users to search the contents of compressed ZIP files attached to "
"messages."
msgstr "사용자가 메시지에 첨부된 압축 ZIP 파일의 콘텐츠를 검색할 수 있도록 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2134
msgid ""
"**true**: Contents of documents within ZIP files are returned in search "
"results. This may have an impact on server performance for large files. "
"the specified local file directory."
msgstr "**true**: ZIP 파일 내 문서의 콘텐츠가 검색 결과에 반환됩니다. 이는 큰 파일의 경우 서버 성능에 영향을 미칠 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2138
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** The contents of documents within ZIP files "
"aren’t returned in search results."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** ZIP 파일 내 문서의 콘텐츠가 검색 결과에 반환되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2132
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``ArchiveRecursion`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``ArchiveRecursion`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2133
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_ARCHIVERECURSION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_ARCHIVERECURSION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2144
msgid ""
"You can search for document content within ZIP files when using "
"Mattermost in a web browser or the desktop app."
msgstr "웹 브라우저 또는 데스크톱 앱에서 OKR.BEST를 사용할 때 ZIP 파일 내 문서 콘텐츠를 검색할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2145
msgid "Searching document contents adds load to your server."
msgstr "문서 콘텐츠를 검색하면 서버에 부하가 추가됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2146
msgid ""
"This setting applies only to standard ZIP files. 7zip (``.7z``) files are"
" blocked for security reasons and are not searchable."
msgstr "이 설정은 표준 ZIP 파일에만 적용됩니다. 7zip(``.7z``) 파일은 보안상의 이유로 차단되며 검색할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2147
msgid ""
"For large deployments, or teams that share many large, text-heavy "
"documents, we recommend you review our :ref:`hardware requirements "
"<deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements:hardware requirements>`,"
" and test enabling this feature in a staging environment before enabling "
"it in a production environment."
msgstr "대규모 배포 또는 많은 대용량 텍스트 중심 문서를 공유하는 팀의 경우 :ref:`하드웨어 요구 사항 <deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements:hardware requirements>`을 검토하고 프로덕션 환경에서 활성화하기 전에 스테이징 환경에서 이 기능을 활성화하여 테스트할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2157
msgid "Amazon S3 bucket"
msgstr "Amazon S3 버킷"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2160
msgid "The name of the bucket for your S3-compatible object storage instance."
msgstr "S3 호환 객체 저장소 인스턴스의 버킷 이름입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2163
msgid "A string with the S3-compatible bucket name."
msgstr "S3 호환 버킷 이름이 포함된 문자열."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2161
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3Bucket``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3Bucket``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2162
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3BUCKET``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3BUCKET``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2174
msgid "Amazon S3 path prefix"
msgstr "Amazon S3 경로 접두사"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2177
msgid "The prefix you selected for your **Amazon S3 bucket** in AWS."
msgstr "AWS에서 **Amazon S3 bucket**에 대해 선택한 접두사입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2179
msgid "A string containing the path prefix."
msgstr "경로 접두사가 포함된 문자열."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2178
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3PathPrefix``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3PathPrefix``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2179
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3PATHPREFIX``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3PATHPREFIX``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2190
msgid "Amazon S3 region"
msgstr "Amazon S3 리전"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2193
msgid ""
"The AWS region you selected when creating your **Amazon S3 bucket** in "
"AWS."
msgstr "AWS에서 **Amazon S3 bucket**을 생성할 때 선택한 AWS 리전입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2196
msgid ""
"A string with the AWS region containing the bucket. If no region is set, "
"Mattermost attempts to get the appropriate region from AWS, and sets it "
"to **us-east-1** if none found."
msgstr "버킷이 포함된 AWS 리전이 있는 문자열. 리전이 설정되지 않은 경우 OKR.BEST는 AWS에서 적절한 리전을 가져오려고 시도하며, 찾지 못하면 **us-east-1**로 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2194
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ```\".FileSettings.AmazonS3Region\",``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ```\".FileSettings.AmazonS3Region\",``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2195
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3REGION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3REGION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2202
msgid ""
"For Digital Ocean Spaces or other S3-compatible services, leave this "
"setting empty."
msgstr "Digital Ocean Spaces 또는 기타 S3 호환 서비스의 경우 이 설정을 비워 둡니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2212
msgid "Amazon S3 access key ID"
msgstr "Amazon S3 액세스 키 ID"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2215
msgid ""
"A string with the access key for the S3-compatible storage instance. Your"
" EC2 administrator can supply you with the Access Key ID."
msgstr "S3 호환 스토리지 인스턴스의 액세스 키가 포함된 문자열. EC2 관리자가 액세스 키 ID를 제공할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2216
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3AccessKeyId``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3AccessKeyId``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2217
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3ACCESSKEYID``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3ACCESSKEYID``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2222
msgid ""
"This is required for access unless you are using an `Amazon S3 IAM Role "
"<https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_use_switch-"
"role-ec2_instance-profiles.html>`__ with Amazon S3."
msgstr "Amazon S3와 함께 `Amazon S3 IAM 역할 <https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_use_switch-role-ec2_instance-profiles.html>`__을 사용하지 않는 한 액세스에 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2232
msgid "Amazon S3 endpoint"
msgstr "Amazon S3 엔드포인트"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2235
msgid "The hostname of your S3-compatible instance."
msgstr "S3 호환 인스턴스의 호스트 이름입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2237
msgid ""
"A string with the hostname of the S3-compatible storage instance. "
"Defaults to **s3.amazonaws.com**."
msgstr "S3 호환 스토리지 인스턴스의 호스트 이름이 포함된 문자열. 기본값은 **s3.amazonaws.com**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2236
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3Endpoint`` > "
"``\"s3.amazonaws.com\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3Endpoint`` > ``\"s3.amazonaws.com\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2237
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3ENDPOINT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3ENDPOINT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2243
msgid ""
"For Digital Ocean Spaces, the hostname should be set to "
"**<region>.digitaloceanspaces.com**, where **<region>** is the "
"abbreviation for the region you selected when setting up the Space. It "
"can be **nyc3**, **ams3**, or **sgp1**."
msgstr "Digital Ocean Spaces의 경우 호스트 이름은 **<region>.digitaloceanspaces.com**으로 설정해야 하며, 여기서 **<region>**은 Space를 설정할 때 선택한 리전의 약어입니다. **nyc3**, **ams3** 또는 **sgp1**일 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2253
msgid "Amazon S3 secret access key"
msgstr "Amazon S3 비밀 액세스 키"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2256
msgid "The secret access key associated with your Amazon S3 Access Key ID."
msgstr "Amazon S3 액세스 키 ID와 연결된 비밀 액세스 키입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2259
msgid ""
"A string with the secret access key for the S3-compatible storage "
"instance."
msgstr "S3 호환 스토리지 인스턴스의 비밀 액세스 키가 포함된 문자열."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2257
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3SecretAccessKey``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3SecretAccessKey``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2258
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3SECRETACCESSKEY``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3SECRETACCESSKEY``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2271
msgid "Enable secure Amazon S3 connections"
msgstr "보안 Amazon S3 연결 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2274
msgid "Enable or disable secure Amazon S3 connections."
msgstr "보안 Amazon S3 연결을 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2276
msgid "**true**: **(Default)** Enables only secure Amazon S3 connections."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 보안 Amazon S3 연결만 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2278
msgid "**false**: Allows insecure connections to Amazon S3."
msgstr "**false**: Amazon S3에 대한 안전하지 않은 연결을 허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2275
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3SSL`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3SSL`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2276
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3SSL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3SSL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2291
msgid "Amazon S3 signature v2"
msgstr "Amazon S3 서명 v2"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2294
msgid ""
"By default, Mattermost uses Signature v4 to sign API calls to AWS, but "
"under some circumstances, v2 is required."
msgstr "기본적으로 OKR.BEST는 Signature v4를 사용하여 AWS에 대한 API 호출에 서명하지만, 일부 상황에서는 v2가 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2297
msgid "**true**: Use Signature v2 signing process."
msgstr "**true**: Signature v2 서명 프로세스를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2298
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Use Signature v4 signing process."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** Signature v4 서명 프로세스를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2295
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3SignV2`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3SignV2`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2296
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3SIGNV2``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3SIGNV2``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2301
msgid ""
"See the `AWS "
"<https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/reference_sigv.html>`_ "
"documentation for information about when to use the Signature v2 signing "
"process."
msgstr "Signature v2 서명 프로세스를 사용해야 하는 시기에 대한 정보는 `AWS <https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/reference_sigv.html>`_ 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2313
msgid "Enable server-side encryption for Amazon S3"
msgstr "Amazon S3에 대한 서버 측 암호화 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2319
msgid "Enable server-side encryption for Amazon S3."
msgstr "Amazon S3에 대한 서버 측 암호화를 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2321
msgid ""
"**true**: Encrypts files in Amazon S3 using server-side encryption with "
"Amazon S3-managed keys."
msgstr "**true**: Amazon S3 관리 키를 사용한 서버 측 암호화로 Amazon S3의 파일을 암호화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2323
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Doesn’t encrypt files in Amazon S3."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** Amazon S3의 파일을 암호화하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2320
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3SSE`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3SSE`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2321
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3SSE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3SSE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2329
msgid "This configuration setting is available for self-hosted deployments only."
msgstr "이 구성 설정은 셀프 호스팅 배포에만 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2341
msgid "Enable Amazon S3 debugging"
msgstr "Amazon S3 디버깅 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2344
msgid ""
"Enable or disable Amazon S3 debugging to capture additional debugging "
"information in system logs."
msgstr "시스템 로그에서 추가 디버깅 정보를 캡처하기 위해 Amazon S3 디버깅을 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2347
msgid ""
"**true**: Log additional debugging information is logged to the system "
"logs."
msgstr "**true**: 추가 디버깅 정보가 시스템 로그에 로깅됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2349
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** No Amazon S3 debugging information is included "
"in the system logs. Typically set to **false** in production."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** Amazon S3 디버깅 정보가 시스템 로그에 포함되지 않습니다. 일반적으로 프로덕션에서는 **false**로 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2345
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3Trace`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3Trace`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2346
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3TRACE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3TRACE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2354
msgid ""
"Select the **Test Connection** button in the System Console to validate "
"the settings and ensure the user can access the server."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Test Connection** 버튼을 선택하여 설정을 검증하고 사용자가 서버에 액세스할 수 있는지 확인합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2364
msgid "Amazon S3 storage class"
msgstr "Amazon S3 스토리지 클래스"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2366
msgid ""
"Some Amazon S3-compatible storage solutions require the storage class "
"parameter to be present in upload requests, otherwise they will be "
"rejected. Configure this storage class as the storage class required by "
"your S3-compatible solution."
msgstr "일부 Amazon S3 호환 스토리지 솔루션은 업로드 요청에 스토리지 클래스 매개변수가 있어야 하며, 그렇지 않으면 거부됩니다. 이 스토리지 클래스를 S3 호환 솔루션에 필요한 스토리지 클래스로 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2369
msgid "The storage class to use for uploads to S3-compatible storage solutions."
msgstr "S3 호환 스토리지 솔루션에 대한 업로드에 사용할 스토리지 클래스입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2372
msgid ""
"String input. Default is an empty string ``\"\"``. Select **Test "
"Connection** to test the configured connection."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 기본값은 빈 문자열 ``\"\"``입니다. **Test Connection**을 선택하여 구성된 연결을 테스트합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2370
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3StorageClass`` > "
"``\"\"``,"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3StorageClass`` > ``\"\"``,"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2371
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3STORAGECLASS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3STORAGECLASS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2378
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2399
msgid ""
"Most Amazon S3-compatible storage solutions assign a default storage "
"class of ``STANDARD`` when no storage class is provided. See the `Amazon "
"S3 storage class "
"<https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/API/API_PutObject.html#AmazonS3"
"-PutObject-request-header-StorageClass>`_ documentation for details about"
" supported storage classes."
msgstr "대부분의 Amazon S3 호환 스토리지 솔루션은 스토리지 클래스가 제공되지 않은 경우 기본 스토리지 클래스 ``STANDARD``를 할당합니다. 지원되는 스토리지 클래스에 대한 자세한 내용은 `Amazon S3 storage class <https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/API/API_PutObject.html#AmazonS3-PutObject-request-header-StorageClass>`_ 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2388
msgid "Export Amazon S3 storage class"
msgstr "Amazon S3 내보내기 스토리지 클래스"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2391
msgid "The storage class to use for exports to S3-compatible storage solutions."
msgstr "S3 호환 스토리지 솔루션에 대한 내보내기에 사용할 스토리지 클래스입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2394
msgid "String input. Default is an empty string ``\"\"``."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 기본값은 빈 문자열 ``\"\"``입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2392
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > "
"``ExportAmazonS3StorageClass`` > ``\"\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``ExportAmazonS3StorageClass`` > ``\"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2393
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_EXPORTAMAZONS3STORAGECLASS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_EXPORTAMAZONS3STORAGECLASS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2409
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2468
msgid "Amazon S3 request timeout"
msgstr "Amazon S3 요청 시간 초과"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2412
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2471
msgid ""
"The amount of time, in milliseconds, before requests to Amazon S3 storage"
" time out."
msgstr "Amazon S3 스토리지에 대한 요청이 시간 초과되기까지의 시간(밀리초)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2415
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2474
msgid "Default is 30000 (30 seconds)."
msgstr "기본값은 30000(30초)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2413
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2472
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > "
"``AmazonS3RequestTimeoutMilliseconds`` > ``30000``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3RequestTimeoutMilliseconds`` > ``30000``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2414
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2473
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3REQUESTTIMEOUTMILLISECONDS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3REQUESTTIMEOUTMILLISECONDS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2426
msgid "Amazon S3 upload part size"
msgstr "Amazon S3 업로드 부분 크기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2429
msgid "The size, in bytes, of each part in a multi-part upload to Amazon S3."
msgstr "Amazon S3에 대한 멀티파트 업로드에서 각 부분의 크기(바이트)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2432
msgid "Numeric value. Default is 5242880 (5MB)."
msgstr "숫자 값. 기본값은 5242880(5MB)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2430
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > "
"``AmazonS3UploadPartSizeBytes`` > ``5242880``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``AmazonS3UploadPartSizeBytes`` > ``5242880``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2431
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3UPLOADPARTSIZEBYTES``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_AMAZONS3UPLOADPARTSIZEBYTES``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2437
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2458
msgid ""
"A smaller part size can result in more requests and an increase in "
"latency, while a larger part size can result in more memory being "
"allocated."
msgstr "부분 크기가 작으면 요청이 늘어나고 대기 시간이 증가할 수 있는 반면, 부분 크기가 크면 더 많은 메모리가 할당될 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2447
msgid "Amazon S3 exported upload part size"
msgstr "Amazon S3 내보내기 업로드 부분 크기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2450
msgid "The size, in bytes, of each part in a multi-part exported to Amazon S3."
msgstr "Amazon S3로 내보낸 멀티파트에서 각 부분의 크기(바이트)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2453
msgid "Numeric value. Default is 104857600 (100MB)."
msgstr "숫자 값. 기본값은 104857600(100MB)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2451
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > "
"``ExportAmazonS3UploadPartSizeBytes`` > ``104857600``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``ExportAmazonS3UploadPartSizeBytes`` > ``104857600``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2452
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_FILESETTINGS_EXPORTAMAZONS3UPLOADPARTSIZEBYTES``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_EXPORTAMAZONS3UPLOADPARTSIZEBYTES``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2485
msgid "Initial font"
