#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2498
msgid "Image proxy"
msgstr "이미지 프록시"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2500
msgid ""
"With self-hosted deployments, an image proxy can be used by Mattermost "
"apps to prevent them from connecting directly to remote self-hosted "
"servers. Configure an image proxy by going to **System Console > "
"Environment > Image Proxy**, or by editing the ``config.json`` file as "
"described in the following tables."
msgstr "셀프 호스팅 배포에서는 이미지 프록시를 OKR.BEST 앱에서 사용하여 원격 셀프 호스팅 서버에 직접 연결하지 못하도록 할 수 있습니다. **System Console > Environment > Image Proxy**로 이동하거나 다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집하여 이미지 프록시를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2512
msgid "Enable image proxy"
msgstr "이미지 프록시 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2515
msgid ""
"An image proxy anonymizes Mattermost app connections and prevents them "
"from accessing insecure content."
msgstr "이미지 프록시는 OKR.BEST 앱 연결을 익명화하고 안전하지 않은 콘텐츠에 액세스하지 못하도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2518
msgid "**true**: Enables an image proxy for loading external images."
msgstr "**true**: 외부 이미지를 로드하기 위한 이미지 프록시를 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2520
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Disables the image proxy."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 이미지 프록시를 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2515
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2539
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2559
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2575
msgid "System Config path: **Environment > Image Proxy**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Environment > Image Proxy**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2516
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ImageProxySettings`` > ``Enable`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ImageProxySettings`` > ``Enable`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2517
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_IMAGEPROXYSETTINGS_ENABLE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_IMAGEPROXYSETTINGS_ENABLE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2523
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2546
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2580
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`image proxy </deployment-guide/server/image-proxy>` "
"documentation to learn more."
msgstr "자세한 내용은 :doc:`이미지 프록시 </deployment-guide/server/image-proxy>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2536
msgid "Image proxy type"
msgstr "이미지 프록시 유형"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2539
msgid "The type of image proxy used by Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 사용하는 이미지 프록시의 유형입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2541
msgid ""
"**local**: **(Default)** The Mattermost server itself acts as the image "
"proxy."
msgstr "**local**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST 서버 자체가 이미지 프록시 역할을 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2543
msgid "**atmos/camo**: An external atmos/camo image proxy is used."
msgstr "**atmos/camo**: 외부 atmos/camo 이미지 프록시가 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2540
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ImageProxySettings`` > ``ImageProxyType`` > "
"``\"local\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ImageProxySettings`` > ``ImageProxyType`` > ``\"local\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2541
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_IMAGEPROXYSETTINGS_IMAGEPROXYTYPE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_IMAGEPROXYSETTINGS_IMAGEPROXYTYPE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2556
msgid "Remote image proxy URL"
msgstr "원격 이미지 프록시 URL"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2559
msgid ""
"The URL of the atmos/camo proxy. This setting isn't needed when using the"
" **local** image proxy."
msgstr "atmos/camo 프록시의 URL입니다. **local** 이미지 프록시를 사용할 때는 이 설정이 필요하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2560
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``ImageProxySettings`` > ``RemoteImageProxyURL``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ImageProxySettings`` > ``RemoteImageProxyURL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2561
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_IMAGEPROXYSETTINGS_REMOTEIMAGEPROXYURL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_IMAGEPROXYSETTINGS_REMOTEIMAGEPROXYURL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2572
msgid "Remote image proxy options"
msgstr "원격 이미지 프록시 옵션"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2575
msgid ""
"The URL signing key passed to an atmos/camo image proxy. This setting "
"isn't needed when using the **local** image proxy type."
msgstr "atmos/camo 이미지 프록시에 전달되는 URL 서명 키입니다. **local** 이미지 프록시 유형을 사용할 때는 이 설정이 필요하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2576
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ImageProxySettings`` > "
"``RemoteImageProxyOptions``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ImageProxySettings`` > ``RemoteImageProxyOptions``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2577
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_IMAGEPROXYSETTINGS_REMOTEIMAGEPROXYOPTIONS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_IMAGEPROXYSETTINGS_REMOTEIMAGEPROXYOPTIONS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2585
msgid "SMTP"
msgstr "SMTP"

