#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2685
msgid "SMTP connection security"
msgstr "SMTP 연결 보안"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2688
msgid "Specify connection security for emails sent using SMTP."
msgstr "SMTP를 사용하여 보내는 이메일에 대한 연결 보안을 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2690
msgid "**Not specified**: **(Default)** Send email over an unsecure connection."
msgstr "**Not specified**: **(기본값)** 안전하지 않은 연결을 통해 이메일을 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2692
msgid ""
"**TLS**: Communication between Mattermost and your email server is "
"encrypted."
msgstr "**TLS**: OKR.BEST와 이메일 서버 간의 통신이 암호화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2694
msgid ""
"**STARTTLS**: Attempts to upgrade an existing insecure connection to a "
"secure connection using TLS."
msgstr "**STARTTLS**: TLS를 사용하여 기존의 안전하지 않은 연결을 보안 연결로 업그레이드하려고 시도합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2689
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``ConnectionSecurity``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``ConnectionSecurity``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2690
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_CONNECTIONSECURITY``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_CONNECTIONSECURITY``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2708
msgid "Skip server certificate verification"
msgstr "서버 인증서 확인 건너뛰기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2711
