#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2714
msgid "**true**: Mattermost won't verify the email server certificate."
msgstr "**true**: OKR.BEST가 이메일 서버 인증서를 확인하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2715
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Mattermost verifies the email server certificate."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST가 이메일 서버 인증서를 확인합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2712
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > "
"``SkipServerCertificateVerification`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``SkipServerCertificateVerification`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2713
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_SKIPSERVERCERTIFICATEVERIFICATION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_SKIPSERVERCERTIFICATEVERIFICATION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2729
msgid "Enable security alerts"
msgstr "보안 경고 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2732
msgid "Enable or disable security alerts."
msgstr "보안 경고를 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2734
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** System admins are notified by email if a relevant"
" security fix alert is announced. Requires email to be enabled."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 관련 보안 수정 경고가 발표되면 시스템 관리자에게 이메일로 알림이 전송됩니다. 이메일이 활성화되어 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2737
msgid "**false**: Security alerts are disabled."
msgstr "**false**: 보안 경고가 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2733
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableSecurityFixAlert``"
" > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableSecurityFixAlert`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2734
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLESECURITYFIXALERT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLESECURITYFIXALERT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2740
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Telemetry <administration-guide/manage/telemetry:security "
"update check feature>` documentation to learn more."
msgstr "자세한 내용은 :ref:`텔레메트리 <administration-guide/manage/telemetry:security update check feature>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2750
msgid "SMTP server timeout"
msgstr "SMTP 서버 시간 초과"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2753
