msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``SMTPServerTimeout``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2755
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_SMTPSERVERTIMEOUT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_SMTPSERVERTIMEOUT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:2763
msgid "Push notification server"
msgstr "푸시 알림 서버"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:3
msgid ""
"With self-hosted deployments, you can configure mobile push notifications"
" for Mattermost by going to **System Console > Environment > Push "
"Notification Server**, or by editing the ``config.json`` file as "
"described in the following tables. Changes to configuration settings in "
"this section require a server restart before taking effect."
msgstr "셀프 호스팅 배포에서는 **System Console > Environment > Push Notification Server**로 이동하거나 다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집하여 OKR.BEST의 모바일 푸시 알림을 구성할 수 있습니다. 이 섹션의 구성 설정을 변경하면 적용되기 전에 서버를 다시 시작해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:17
msgid "Enable push notifications"
msgstr "푸시 알림 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:20
msgid "Enable or disable Mattermost push notifications."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 푸시 알림을 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Do not send push notifications**: Mobile push notifications are "
"disabled."
msgstr "**Do not send push notifications**: 모바일 푸시 알림이 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:24
