"**Use HPNS connection with uptime SLA to send notifications to iOS and "
"Android apps**: **(Default)** Use Mattermost's hosted push notification "
"service."
msgstr "**Use HPNS connection with uptime SLA to send notifications to iOS and Android apps**: **(기본값)** Mattermost의 호스팅된 푸시 알림 서비스를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Use TPNS connection to send notifications to iOS and Android apps**: "
"Use Mattermost's test push notification service."
msgstr "**Use TPNS connection to send notifications to iOS and Android apps**: Mattermost의 테스트 푸시 알림 서비스를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Manually enter Push Notification Service location**: When building your"
" own custom mobile apps, you must host your own mobile push proxy "
"service, and specify that URL in the **Push Notification Server** field."
msgstr "**Manually enter Push Notification Service location**: 자체 사용자 지정 모바일 앱을 빌드하는 경우 자체 모바일 푸시 프록시 서비스를 호스팅하고 해당 URL을 **Push Notification Server** 필드에 지정해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:20
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:103
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:122
msgid "System Config path: **Environment > Push Notification Server**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Environment > Push Notification Server**"

