#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:37
msgid "Hosted Push Notifications Service (HPNS)"
msgstr "호스팅된 푸시 알림 서비스(HPNS)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:39
msgid ""
"Mattermost Enterprise, Professional, and Cloud customers can use "
"Mattermost's Hosted Push Notification Service (HPNS). The HPNS offers:"
msgstr "Mattermost Enterprise, Professional, Cloud 고객은 Mattermost의 호스팅된 푸시 알림 서비스(HPNS)를 사용할 수 있습니다. HPNS는 다음을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:41
msgid ""
"Access to a publicly-hosted Mattermost Push Notification Service (MPNS) "
"`available on GitHub. <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-push-"
"proxy>`__"
msgstr "`GitHub에서 사용 가능한 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-push-proxy>`__ 공개적으로 호스팅된 Mattermost Push Notification Service(MPNS)에 대한 액세스."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:42
msgid ""
"An explicit `privacy policy <https://mattermost.com/data-processing-"
"addendum/>`__ for the contents of unencrypted messages."
msgstr "암호화되지 않은 메시지의 콘텐츠에 대한 명시적인 `개인정보 보호정책 <https://mattermost.com/data-processing-addendum/>`__."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/push-notification-server-configuration-settings.rst:43
