#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3128
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3496
msgid "Colorize plain text console logs"
msgstr "일반 텍스트 콘솔 로그 색상화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3131
msgid ""
"Enables system admins to display plain text general log level details in "
"color."
msgstr "시스템 관리자가 일반 텍스트 일반 로그 수준 세부 정보를 색상으로 표시할 수 있도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3134
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3502
msgid ""
"**true**: When logged events are output to the console as plain text, "
"colorize log levels details."
msgstr "**true**: 로깅된 이벤트가 일반 텍스트로 콘솔에 출력될 때 로그 수준 세부 정보를 색상화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3137
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3505
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Plain text log details aren't colorized in the "
"console."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 일반 텍스트 로그 세부 정보가 콘솔에서 색상화되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3132
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LogSettings`` > ``EnableColor`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LogSettings`` > ``EnableColor`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3133
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_ENABLECOLOR``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_ENABLECOLOR``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3152
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3520
msgid "Output logs to file"
msgstr "파일에 로그 출력"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3155
msgid "Configure Mattermost to output general console logs to a file."
msgstr "일반 콘솔 로그를 파일에 출력하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3158
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Logged events are written based on the `file log "
"level <#file-log-level>`__ configuration to a ``mattermost.log`` file "
"located in the directory configured via ``file location``."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** `파일 로그 수준 <#file-log-level>`__ 구성을 기반으로 로깅된 이벤트가 ``file location``을 통해 구성된 디렉토리에 있는 ``mattermost.log`` 파일에 기록됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3164
msgid "**false**: Logged events aren’t written to a file."
msgstr "**false**: 로깅된 이벤트가 파일에 기록되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3156
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LogSettings`` > ``EnableFile`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LogSettings`` > ``EnableFile`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3157
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_ENABLEFILE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_ENABLEFILE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3170
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v11.0, notification logs are automatically included in "
"the main file logs."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v11.0부터 알림 로그가 기본 파일 로그에 자동으로 포함됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3171
msgid ""
"This setting is typically set to **true** in a production environment. "
"When enabled, you can download the ``mattermost.log`` file locally by "
"going to **System Console > Reporting > Server Logs**, and selecting "
"**Download Logs**."
msgstr "이 설정은 일반적으로 프로덕션 환경에서 **true**로 설정됩니다. 활성화하면 **System Console > Reporting > Server Logs**로 이동하여 **Download Logs**를 선택하여 ``mattermost.log`` 파일을 로컬로 다운로드할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3181
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3544
msgid "File log directory"
msgstr "파일 로그 디렉토리"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3184
msgid "The location of the general log files."
msgstr "일반 로그 파일의 위치입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3186
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3549
msgid ""
"String input. If left blank, log files are stored in the ``./logs`` "
"directory."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 비워 두면 로그 파일이 ``./logs`` 디렉토리에 저장됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3185
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LogSettings`` > ``FileLocation`` > ``\"\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LogSettings`` > ``FileLocation`` > ``\"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3186
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_FILELOCATION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_FILELOCATION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3192
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3555
msgid ""
"The path you configure must exist, and Mattermost must have write "
"permissions for this directory."
msgstr "구성하는 경로가 존재해야 하며 OKR.BEST가 이 디렉토리에 대한 쓰기 권한이 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3193
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v11.4, you can use the ``MM_LOG_PATH`` environment "
"variable to restrict log file locations to a designated root directory. "
"This security enhancement ensures that all log files configured via "
"``LogSettings.FileLocation`` or ``LogSettings.AdvancedLoggingJSON`` "
"remain within an authorized logging directory."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v11.4부터 ``MM_LOG_PATH`` 환경 변수를 사용하여 로그 파일 위치를 지정된 루트 디렉토리로 제한할 수 있습니다. 이 보안 강화는 ``LogSettings.FileLocation`` 또는 ``LogSettings.AdvancedLoggingJSON``을 통해 구성된 모든 로그 파일이 승인된 로깅 디렉토리 내에 유지되도록 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3195
msgid ""
"If ``MM_LOG_PATH`` isn't set, the default ``logs`` directory is used. "
"Paths outside the root directory generate error logs and are excluded "
"from :doc:`support packet </administration-guide/manage/admin/generating-"
"support-packet>` downloads. See the :ref:`log path restrictions "
"<administration-guide/manage/logging:log path restrictions>` "
"documentation for details."
msgstr "``MM_LOG_PATH``가 설정되지 않은 경우 기본 ``logs`` 디렉토리가 사용됩니다. 루트 디렉토리 외부의 경로는 오류 로그를 생성하며 :doc:`지원 패킷 </administration-guide/manage/admin/generating-support-packet>` 다운로드에서 제외됩니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`로그 경로 제한 <administration-guide/manage/logging:log path restrictions>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3209
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3569
msgid "File log level"
msgstr "파일 로그 수준"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3212
msgid ""
"The level of detail in general log events when when Mattermost outputs "
"log messages to a file."
msgstr "OKR.BEST가 파일에 로그 메시지를 출력할 때 일반 로그 이벤트의 세부 수준입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3215
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3575
msgid "**DEBUG**: Outputs verbose detail for developers debugging issues."
msgstr "**DEBUG**: 문제를 디버깅하는 개발자를 위한 상세한 세부 정보를 출력합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3218
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3578
msgid ""
"**INFO**: **(Default)** Outputs error messages and information around "
"startup and initialization."
msgstr "**INFO**: **(기본값)** 오류 메시지와 시작 및 초기화에 대한 정보를 출력합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3213
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LogSettings`` > ``FileLevel`` > ``\"INFO\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LogSettings`` > ``FileLevel`` > ``\"INFO\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3214
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_FILELEVEL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_FILELEVEL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3234
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3594
msgid "Output file logs as JSON"
msgstr "파일 로그를 JSON으로 출력"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3237
msgid "Configure Mattermost to output general file logs as JSON."
msgstr "일반 파일 로그를 JSON으로 출력하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3238
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LogSettings`` > ``FileJson`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LogSettings`` > ``FileJson`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3239
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_FILEJSON``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_FILEJSON``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3259
msgid "Enable webhook debugging"
msgstr "웹훅 디버깅 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3262
msgid ""
"Configure Mattermost to capture the contents of general incoming webhooks"
" to console and/or file logs for debugging."
msgstr "디버깅을 위해 일반 수신 웹훅의 콘텐츠를 콘솔 및/또는 파일 로그에 캡처하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3266
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** The contents of incoming webhooks are printed to "
"log files for debugging."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 수신 웹훅의 콘텐츠가 디버깅을 위해 로그 파일에 출력됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3269
msgid "**false**: The contents of incoming webhooks aren’t printed to log files."
msgstr "**false**: 수신 웹훅의 콘텐츠가 로그 파일에 출력되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3263
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LogSettings`` > ``EnableWebhookDebugging`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LogSettings`` > ``EnableWebhookDebugging`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3264
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_ENABLEWEBHOOKDEBUGGING``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_ENABLEWEBHOOKDEBUGGING``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3275
msgid ""
"Enable debug logs by changing the `file log level <#file-log-level>`__ to"
" ``DEBUG`` to include the request body of incoming webhooks in logs."
msgstr "`파일 로그 수준 <#file-log-level>`__을 ``DEBUG``로 변경하여 디버그 로그를 활성화하면 수신 웹훅의 요청 본문이 로그에 포함됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3285
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3614
msgid "Output logs to multiple targets"
msgstr "여러 대상에 로그 출력"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3288
msgid ""
"Configure Mattermost to allow any combination of console, local file, "
"syslog, and TCP socket targets, and send general log records to multiple "
"targets."
msgstr "콘솔, 로컬 파일, syslog, TCP 소켓 대상의 모든 조합을 허용하고 일반 로그 레코드를 여러 대상으로 보내도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3293
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3622
msgid ""
"String input can contain a filespec to another configuration file, a "
"database DSN, or JSON."
msgstr "문자열 입력에는 다른 구성 파일에 대한 파일 사양, 데이터베이스 DSN 또는 JSON이 포함될 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3289
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LogSettings`` > ``AdvancedLoggingJSON`` > "
"``\": \"\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LogSettings`` > ``AdvancedLoggingJSON`` > ``\": \"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3290
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_ADVANCEDLOGGINGJSON``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_ADVANCEDLOGGINGJSON``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3300
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`Mattermost logging </administration-guide/manage/logging>` "
"documentation for details. These targets have been chosen as they support"
" the vast majority of log aggregators, and other log analysis tools, "
"without needing additional software installed."
msgstr "자세한 내용은 :doc:`OKR.BEST 로깅 </administration-guide/manage/logging>` 문서를 참조하세요. 이러한 대상은 추가 소프트웨어를 설치할 필요 없이 대다수의 로그 수집기 및 기타 로그 분석 도구를 지원하므로 선택되었습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3301
msgid "Logs are recorded asynchronously to reduce latency to the caller."
msgstr "로그는 호출자에 대한 대기 시간을 줄이기 위해 비동기적으로 기록됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3302
msgid "Advanced logging supports hot-reloading of logger configuration."
msgstr "고급 로깅은 로거 구성의 핫 리로딩을 지원합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3303
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v11.4, file paths specified in ``AdvancedLoggingJSON`` "
"configurations should be within the directory specified by the "
"``MM_LOG_PATH`` environment variable. See :ref:`log path restrictions "
"<administration-guide/manage/logging:log path restrictions>` for details."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v11.4부터 ``AdvancedLoggingJSON`` 구성에 지정된 파일 경로는 ``MM_LOG_PATH`` 환경 변수로 지정된 디렉토리 내에 있어야 합니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`로그 경로 제한 <administration-guide/manage/logging:log path restrictions>`을 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3313
msgid "Maximum field size"
msgstr "최대 필드 크기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3316
msgid ""
"Enables system admins to limit the size of general log fields during "
"logging."
msgstr "시스템 관리자가 로깅 중에 일반 로그 필드의 크기를 제한할 수 있도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3319
msgid "Numerical value. Default is **2048**."
msgstr "숫자 값. 기본값은 **2048**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3317
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LogSettings`` > ``MaxFieldSize`` > ``2048``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LogSettings`` > ``MaxFieldSize`` > ``2048``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3318
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_MAXFIELDSIZE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_MAXFIELDSIZE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3330
msgid "Enable diagnostics and error reporting"
msgstr "진단 및 오류 보고 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3333
msgid ""
"Whether or not general diagnostics and error reports are sent to "
"Mattermost, Inc."
msgstr "일반 진단 및 오류 보고서를 Mattermost, Inc.에 보낼지 여부입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3336
msgid "**true**: **(Default)** Send diagnostics and error reports."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 진단 및 오류 보고서를 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3338
msgid "**false**: Diagnostics and error reports aren't sent."
msgstr "**false**: 진단 및 오류 보고서가 전송되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3334
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LogSettings`` > ``EnableDiagnostics`` > "
"``\"\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LogSettings`` > ``EnableDiagnostics`` > ``\"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3335
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_ENABLEDIAGNOSTICS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_ENABLEDIAGNOSTICS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3344
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`telemetry <administration-guide/manage/telemetry:error and "
"diagnostics reporting feature>` docummentation for details on the "
"information Mattermost collects."
msgstr "OKR.BEST가 수집하는 정보에 대한 자세한 내용은 :ref:`텔레메트리 <administration-guide/manage/telemetry:error and diagnostics reporting feature>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3357
msgid "Enable verbose diagnostics"
msgstr "상세 진단 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3360
msgid "Whether or not verbose general diagnostics information is sent."
msgstr "상세한 일반 진단 정보를 보낼지 여부입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3363
msgid "**true**: Send verbose diagnostics information."
msgstr "**true**: 상세한 진단 정보를 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3365
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Verbose diagnostics information isn't sent."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 상세한 진단 정보가 전송되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3361
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LogSettings`` > ``VerboseDiagnostics`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LogSettings`` > ``VerboseDiagnostics`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3362
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_VERBOSEDIAGNOSTICS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_VERBOSEDIAGNOSTICS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3380
msgid "Enable Sentry reporting"
msgstr "Sentry 보고 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3383
msgid "Whether or not general error reports are sent to Sentry."
msgstr "일반 오류 보고서를 Sentry에 보낼지 여부입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3386
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Send error reports to Sentry. Default matches the"
" EnableDiagnostics setting."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 오류 보고서를 Sentry에 보냅니다. 기본값은 EnableDiagnostics 설정과 일치합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3389
msgid "**false**: Error reports are not sent to Sentry."
msgstr "**false**: 오류 보고서가 Sentry에 전송되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3384
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LogSettings`` > ``EnableSentry`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LogSettings`` > ``EnableSentry`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3385
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_ENABLESENTRY``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LOGSETTINGS_ENABLESENTRY``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3396
msgid "Notification logging"
msgstr "알림 로깅"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3400
msgid ""
"**From Mattermost v11, notification log settings have been consolidated "
"into the standard console logs and mattermost.log file**. You can no "
"longer disable notification logging without using advanced logging "
"settings, as the main log level setting now controls both server and "
"notification logs."
msgstr "**OKR.BEST v11부터 알림 로그 설정이 표준 콘솔 로그와 mattermost.log 파일로 통합되었습니다**. 이제 기본 로그 수준 설정이 서버 로그와 알림 로그를 모두 제어하므로 고급 로깅 설정을 사용하지 않고는 알림 로깅을 비활성화할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3402
msgid ""
"You can use the ``AdvancedLoggingJSON`` configuration with discrete "
"notification log levels: ``NotificationError``, ``NotificationWarn``, "
"``NotificationInfo``, ``NotificationDebug``, and ``NotificationTrace`` to"
" split notification logs into separate files and reduce troubleshooting "
"noise. See :ref:`Advanced Logging <administration-"
"guide/manage/logging:advanced logging>` for details."
msgstr "개별 알림 로그 수준 ``NotificationError``, ``NotificationWarn``, ``NotificationInfo``, ``NotificationDebug``, ``NotificationTrace``와 함께 ``AdvancedLoggingJSON`` 구성을 사용하여 알림 로그를 별도의 파일로 분할하고 문제 해결 노이즈를 줄일 수 있습니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`고급 로깅 <administration-guide/manage/logging:advanced logging>`을 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3404
msgid ""
"The following configuration settings apply only to Mattermost server "
"versions prior to v11.0."
msgstr "다음 구성 설정은 v11.0 이전 OKR.BEST 서버 버전에만 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3406
msgid ""
"You can configure logging specifically for Mattermost notifications by "
"editing the ``config.json`` file as described in the following tables. "
"These settings operate independently from the main ``LogSettings`` and "
"allow you to customize logging behavior specifically for the notification"
" subsystem. Changes to these configuration settings require a server "
"restart before taking effect."
msgstr "다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집하여 OKR.BEST 알림에 대한 로깅을 구체적으로 구성할 수 있습니다. 이러한 설정은 기본 ``LogSettings``와 독립적으로 작동하며 알림 하위 시스템에 대한 로깅 동작을 구체적으로 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다. 이러한 구성 설정을 변경하면 적용되기 전에 서버를 다시 시작해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3421
msgid "Configure Mattermost to output notification logs to the console."
msgstr "알림 로그를 콘솔에 출력하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3429
msgid "**false**: Output log messages aren't written to the console."
msgstr "**false**: 출력 로그 메시지가 콘솔에 기록되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3422
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``EnableConsole`` "
"> ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``EnableConsole`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3423
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_ENABLECONSOLE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_ENABLECONSOLE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3448
msgid ""
"The level of detail in notification log events written when Mattermost "
"outputs log messages to the console."
msgstr "OKR.BEST가 콘솔에 로그 메시지를 출력할 때 기록되는 알림 로그 이벤트의 세부 수준입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3449
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``ConsoleLevel`` >"
" ``\"DEBUG\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``ConsoleLevel`` > ``\"DEBUG\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3450
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_CONSOLELEVEL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_CONSOLELEVEL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3474
msgid "Configure Mattermost to output notification console logs as JSON."
msgstr "알림 콘솔 로그를 JSON으로 출력하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3475
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``ConsoleJson`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``ConsoleJson`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3476
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_CONSOLEJSON``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_CONSOLEJSON``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3499
msgid ""
"Enables system admins to display plain text notification log level "
"details in color."
msgstr "시스템 관리자가 일반 텍스트 알림 로그 수준 세부 정보를 색상으로 표시할 수 있도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3500
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``EnableColor`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``EnableColor`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3501
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_ENABLECOLOR``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_ENABLECOLOR``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3523
msgid "Configure Mattermost to output notification console logs to a file."
msgstr "알림 콘솔 로그를 파일에 출력하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3526
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Logged events are written based on the `file log "
"level <#file-log-level>`__ configuration to a ``notifications.log`` file "
"located in the directory configured via ``file location``."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** `파일 로그 수준 <#file-log-level>`__ 구성을 기반으로 로깅된 이벤트가 ``file location``을 통해 구성된 디렉토리에 있는 ``notifications.log`` 파일에 기록됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3532
msgid "**false**: Logged events aren't written to a file."
msgstr "**false**: 로깅된 이벤트가 파일에 기록되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3524
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``EnableFile`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``EnableFile`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3525
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_ENABLEFILE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_ENABLEFILE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3547
msgid "The location of the notification log files."
msgstr "알림 로그 파일의 위치입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3548
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``FileLocation`` >"
" ``\"\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``FileLocation`` > ``\"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3549
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_FILELOCATION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_FILELOCATION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3572
msgid ""
"The level of detail in notification log events when Mattermost outputs "
"log messages to a file."
msgstr "OKR.BEST가 파일에 로그 메시지를 출력할 때 알림 로그 이벤트의 세부 수준입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3573
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``FileLevel`` > "
"``\"INFO\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``FileLevel`` > ``\"INFO\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3574
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_FILELEVEL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_FILELEVEL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3597
msgid "Configure Mattermost to output notification file logs as JSON."
msgstr "알림 파일 로그를 JSON으로 출력하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3598
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``FileJson`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``FileJson`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3599
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_FILEJSON``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_FILEJSON``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3617
msgid ""
"Configure Mattermost to allow any combination of console, local file, "
"syslog, and TCP socket targets, and send notification log records to "
"multiple targets."
msgstr "콘솔, 로컬 파일, syslog, TCP 소켓 대상의 모든 조합을 허용하고 알림 로그 레코드를 여러 대상으로 보내도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3618
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > "
"``AdvancedLoggingJSON`` > ``\": \"\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``NotificationLogSettings`` > ``AdvancedLoggingJSON`` > ``\": \"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3619
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_ADVANCEDLOGGINGJSON``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_NOTIFICATIONLOGSETTINGS_ADVANCEDLOGGINGJSON``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3630
msgid "Audit logging"
msgstr "감사 로깅"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3635
msgid ""
"Configure audit logging by going to **System Console > Compliance > Audit"
" Logging**, or by editing the ``config.json`` file as described in the "
"following tables. These settings operate independently from the main "
"``LogSettings`` and allow you to customize logging behavior specifically "
"for the audit subsystem. Changes to these configuration settings require "
"a server restart before taking effect."
msgstr "**System Console > Compliance > Audit Logging**으로 이동하거나 다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집하여 감사 로깅을 구성합니다. 이러한 설정은 기본 ``LogSettings``와 독립적으로 작동하며 감사 하위 시스템에 대한 로깅 동작을 구체적으로 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다. 이러한 구성 설정을 변경하면 적용되기 전에 서버를 다시 시작해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3648
msgid "Output audit logs to file"
msgstr "감사 로그를 파일에 출력"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3651
msgid "Whether to write audit log files to disk."
msgstr "감사 로그 파일을 디스크에 기록할지 여부입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3653
msgid ""
"**true**: Logged events are written to the file specified by the audit "
"file name configuration setting."
msgstr "**true**: 로깅된 이벤트가 감사 파일 이름 구성 설정으로 지정된 파일에 기록됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3656
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Audit log files aren't written."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 감사 로그 파일이 기록되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3651
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3675
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3699
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3716
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3733
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3753
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3772
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3805
msgid "System Config path: **Compliance > Audit Logging**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Compliance > Audit Logging**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3652
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > ``FileEnabled`` "
"> ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > ``FileEnabled`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3653
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILEENABLED``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILEENABLED``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3662
msgid ""
"When ``FileEnabled`` is set to **true**, then the `audit file name "
"<#auditlog-filename>`__ must be set."
msgstr "``FileEnabled``가 **true**로 설정된 경우 `감사 파일 이름 <#auditlog-filename>`__을 설정해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3672
msgid "Audit file name"
msgstr "감사 파일 이름"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3675
msgid "The name of the audit log files."
msgstr "감사 로그 파일의 이름입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3677
msgid ""
"The path that you set to the audit file must exist and Mattermost must "
"have write permissions in it."
msgstr "감사 파일에 설정하는 경로가 존재해야 하며 OKR.BEST가 해당 경로에 대한 쓰기 권한이 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3681
msgid "**Example:** ``/var/log/mattermost_audit.log``"
msgstr "**예시:** ``/var/log/mattermost_audit.log``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3676
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > ``FileName`` > "
"``\"\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > ``FileName`` > ``\"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3677
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILENAME``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILENAME``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3686
msgid ""
"The file name must be set to `enable <#auditlog-fileenabled>`__ audit "
"logging."
msgstr "감사 로깅을 `활성화 <#auditlog-fileenabled>`__하려면 파일 이름을 설정해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3699
msgid "The maximum size in megabytes for audit log files before they are rotated."
msgstr "감사 로그 파일이 순환되기 전의 최대 크기(메가바이트)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3702
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **100** MB."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **100** MB입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3700
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > "
"``FileMaxSizeMB`` > ``100``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > ``FileMaxSizeMB`` > ``100``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3701
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILEMAXSIZEMB``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILEMAXSIZEMB``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3713
msgid "Maximum file age"
msgstr "최대 파일 수명"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3716
msgid "The maximum age in days for audit log files before they are deleted."
msgstr "감사 로그 파일이 삭제되기 전의 최대 수명(일)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3719
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3736
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **0** (no limit)."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **0**(제한 없음)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3717
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > "
"``FileMaxAgeDays`` > ``0``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > ``FileMaxAgeDays`` > ``0``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3718
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILEMAXAGEDAYS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILEMAXAGEDAYS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3730
msgid "Maximum file backups"
msgstr "최대 파일 백업 수"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3733
msgid "The maximum number of audit log file backups to retain."
msgstr "보존할 감사 로그 파일 백업의 최대 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3734
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > "
"``FileMaxBackups`` > ``0``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > ``FileMaxBackups`` > ``0``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3735
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILEMAXBACKUPS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILEMAXBACKUPS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3750
msgid "Compress audit log files"
msgstr "감사 로그 파일 압축"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3753
msgid "Whether to compress rotated audit log files."
msgstr "순환된 감사 로그 파일을 압축할지 여부입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3755
msgid "**true**: Rotated audit log files are compressed."
msgstr "**true**: 순환된 감사 로그 파일이 압축됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3757
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Rotated audit log files aren't compressed."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 순환된 감사 로그 파일이 압축되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3754
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > ``FileCompress``"
" > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > ``FileCompress`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3755
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILECOMPRESS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILECOMPRESS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3769
msgid "Audit log queue size"
msgstr "감사 로그 큐 크기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3772
msgid "The maximum number of audit log entries that can be queued."
msgstr "큐에 대기할 수 있는 최대 감사 로그 항목 수입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3773
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > "
"``FileMaxQueueSize`` > ``1000``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > ``FileMaxQueueSize`` > ``1000``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3774
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILEMAXQUEUESIZE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_FILEMAXQUEUESIZE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3786
msgid "Audit log certificate"
msgstr "감사 로그 인증서"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3789
msgid "Certificate configuration for audit logging."
msgstr "감사 로깅을 위한 인증서 구성입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3791
msgid "String input. Default is blank."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 기본값은 비어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3790
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > ``Certificate`` "
"> ``\"\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > ``Certificate`` > ``\"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3791
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_CERTIFICATE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_CERTIFICATE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3802
msgid "Output audit logs to multiple targets"
msgstr "여러 대상에 감사 로그 출력"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3805
msgid "Configures Mattermost to output audit log records to multiple targets."
msgstr "감사 로그 레코드를 여러 대상으로 출력하도록 OKR.BEST를 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3806
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > "
"``AdvancedLoggingJSON`` > ``{}``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` > ``AdvancedLoggingJSON`` > ``{}``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3807
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_ADVANCEDLOGGINGJSON``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EXPERIMENTALAUDITSETTINGS_ADVANCEDLOGGINGJSON``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3812
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`Mattermost logging </administration-guide/manage/logging>` "
"documentation for details on advanced logging configuration. These "
"targets have been chosen as they support the vast majority of log "
"aggregators, and other log analysis tools, without needing additional "
"software installed."
msgstr "고급 로깅 구성에 대한 자세한 내용은 :doc:`OKR.BEST 로깅 </administration-guide/manage/logging>` 문서를 참조하세요. 이러한 대상은 추가 소프트웨어를 설치할 필요 없이 대다수의 로그 수집기 및 기타 로그 분석 도구를 지원하므로 선택되었습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3813
msgid "Audit logs are recorded asynchronously to reduce latency to the caller."
msgstr "감사 로그는 호출자에 대한 대기 시간을 줄이기 위해 비동기적으로 기록됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3814
msgid "Advanced audit logging supports hot-reloading of logger configuration."
msgstr "고급 감사 로깅은 로거 구성의 핫 리로딩을 지원합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3819
msgid "Session lengths"
msgstr "세션 길이"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3821
msgid ""
"With self-hosted deployments, user sessions are cleared when a user tries"
" to log in, and sessions are cleared every 24 hours from the sessions "
"database table. Configure session lengths by going to **System Console > "
"Environment > Session Lengths**, or by editing the ``config.json`` file "
"as described in the following tables. Changes to configuration settings "
"in this section require a server restart before taking effect."
msgstr "셀프 호스팅 배포에서는 사용자가 로그인을 시도할 때 사용자 세션이 지워지며, 세션 데이터베이스 테이블에서 24시간마다 세션이 지워집니다. **System Console > Environment > Session Lengths**로 이동하거나 다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집하여 세션 길이를 구성합니다. 이 섹션의 구성 설정을 변경하면 적용되기 전에 서버를 다시 시작해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3833
msgid "Extend session length with activity"
msgstr "활동으로 세션 길이 연장"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3836
msgid ""
"Improves the user experience by extending sessions and keeping users "
"logged in if they are active in their Mattermost apps."
msgstr "사용자가 OKR.BEST 앱에서 활동 중인 경우 세션을 연장하고 사용자가 로그인 상태를 유지하도록 하여 사용자 경험을 개선합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3839
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Sessions are automatically extended when users "
"are active in their Mattermost client. User sessions only expire when "
"users aren’t active in their Mattermost client for the entire duration of"
" the session lengths defined."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 사용자가 OKR.BEST 클라이언트에서 활동 중일 때 세션이 자동으로 연장됩니다. 사용자 세션은 정의된 세션 길이의 전체 기간 동안 사용자가 OKR.BEST 클라이언트에서 활동하지 않을 때만 만료됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3844
msgid ""
"**false**: Sessions won't extend with activity in Mattermost. User "
"sessions immediately expire at the end of the session length or based on "
"the `session idle timeout <#session-idle-timeout>`__ configured."
msgstr "**false**: 세션이 OKR.BEST의 활동으로 연장되지 않습니다. 사용자 세션은 세션 길이가 끝날 때 또는 구성된 `세션 유휴 시간 초과 <#session-idle-timeout>`__를 기반으로 즉시 만료됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3836
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3863
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3892
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3915
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3937
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3963
msgid "System Config path: **Environment > Session Lengths**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Environment > Session Lengths**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3837
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``ExtendSessionLengthWithActivity`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``ExtendSessionLengthWithActivity`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3838
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_EXTENDSESSIONLENGTHWITHACTIVITY``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_EXTENDSESSIONLENGTHWITHACTIVITY``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3860
msgid "Terminate sessions on password change"
msgstr "비밀번호 변경 시 세션 종료"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3863
msgid "Enable or disable session revocation when a user's password changes."
msgstr "사용자의 비밀번호가 변경될 때 세션 해지를 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3866
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default for new deployments)** Session revocation is "
"enabled. All sessions of a user expire if their password is changed (by "
"themselves or by a system admin). If the password change is initiated by "
"the user, their current session isn't terminated."
msgstr "**true**: **(새 배포의 기본값)** 세션 해지가 활성화됩니다. 사용자의 비밀번호가 변경되면(본인 또는 시스템 관리자에 의해) 해당 사용자의 모든 세션이 만료됩니다. 비밀번호 변경이 사용자에 의해 시작된 경우 현재 세션은 종료되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3872
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default for existing deployments)** Session revocation is "
"disabled. When users change their password, only the user's current "
"session is revoked. When a system admin changes the user's password, none"
" of the user's sessions are revoked."
msgstr "**false**: **(기존 배포의 기본값)** 세션 해지가 비활성화됩니다. 사용자가 비밀번호를 변경하면 사용자의 현재 세션만 해지됩니다. 시스템 관리자가 사용자의 비밀번호를 변경하면 사용자의 어떤 세션도 해지되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3864
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``TerminateSessionsOnPasswordChange`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``TerminateSessionsOnPasswordChange`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3865
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TERMINATESESSIONSONPASSWORDCHANGE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_TERMINATESESSIONSONPASSWORDCHANGE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3889
msgid "Session length for AD/LDAP and email"
msgstr "AD/LDAP 및 이메일에 대한 세션 길이"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3892
msgid ""
"Set the number of hours counted from the last time a user entered their "
"credentials into the web app or the desktop app to the expiry of the "
"user’s session on email and AD/LDAP authentication."
msgstr "사용자가 마지막으로 웹 앱이나 데스크톱 앱에 자격 증명을 입력한 시점부터 이메일 및 AD/LDAP 인증에서 사용자 세션 만료까지 계산되는 시간 수를 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3897
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3919
msgid "Numerical input in hours. Default is **720** hours."
msgstr "시간 단위 숫자 입력. 기본값은 **720**시간입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3893
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``SessionLengthWebInHours`` > ``720``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``SessionLengthWebInHours`` > ``720``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3894
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_SESSIONLENGTHWEBINHOURS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_SESSIONLENGTHWEBINHOURS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3902
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3924
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3949
msgid ""
"After changing this setting, the new session length takes effect after "
"the next time the user enters their credentials."
msgstr "이 설정을 변경한 후 새 세션 길이는 사용자가 다음에 자격 증명을 입력한 후에 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3912
msgid "Session length for mobile"
msgstr "모바일에 대한 세션 길이"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3915
msgid ""
"Set the number of hours counted from the last time a user entered their "
"credential into the mobile app to the expiry of the user’s session."
msgstr "사용자가 마지막으로 모바일 앱에 자격 증명을 입력한 시점부터 사용자 세션 만료까지 계산되는 시간 수를 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3916
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``SessionLengthMobileInHours`` > ``720``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``SessionLengthMobileInHours`` > ``720``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3917
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_SESSIONLENGTHMOBILEINHOURS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_SESSIONLENGTHMOBILEINHOURS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3934
msgid "Session length for SSO"
msgstr "SSO에 대한 세션 길이"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3937
msgid ""
"Set the number of hours from the last time a user entered their SSO "
"credentials to the expiry of the user’s session. This setting defines the"
" session length for SSO authentication, such as SAML, GitLab, and OAuth "
"2.0."
msgstr "사용자가 마지막으로 SSO 자격 증명을 입력한 시점부터 사용자 세션 만료까지의 시간 수를 설정합니다. 이 설정은 SAML, GitLab, OAuth 2.0과 같은 SSO 인증에 대한 세션 길이를 정의합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3942
msgid ""
"Numerical input in hours. Default is **720** hours. Numbers as decimals "
"are also valid values for this configuration setting."
msgstr "시간 단위 숫자 입력. 기본값은 **720**시간입니다. 소수 형태의 숫자도 이 구성 설정의 유효한 값입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3938
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``SessionLengthSSOInHours`` > ``720``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``SessionLengthSSOInHours`` > ``720``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3939
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_SESSIONLENGTHSSOINHOURS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_SESSIONLENGTHSSOINHOURS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3950
msgid ""
"If the authentication method is SAML, GitLab, or OAuth 2.0, users may "
"automatically be logged back in to Mattermost if they are already logged "
"in to SAML, GitLab, or with OAuth 2.0."
msgstr "인증 방법이 SAML, GitLab 또는 OAuth 2.0인 경우 사용자가 이미 SAML, GitLab 또는 OAuth 2.0으로 로그인되어 있으면 자동으로 OKR.BEST에 다시 로그인될 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3960
msgid "Session cache"
msgstr "세션 캐시"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3963
msgid "Set the number of minutes to cache a session in memory."
msgstr "세션을 메모리에 캐시할 시간(분)을 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3965
msgid "Numerical input in minutes. Default is **10** minutes."
msgstr "분 단위 숫자 입력. 기본값은 **10**분입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3964
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``SessionCacheInMinutes`` "
"> ``10``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``SessionCacheInMinutes`` > ``10``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3965
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_SESSIONCACHEINMINUTES``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_SESSIONCACHEINMINUTES``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3978
msgid "Session idle timeout"
msgstr "세션 유휴 시간 초과"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3981
msgid ""
"The number of minutes from the last time a user was active on the system "
"to the expiry of the user’s session. Once expired, the user will need to "
"log in to continue."
msgstr "사용자가 마지막으로 시스템에서 활동한 시점부터 사용자 세션 만료까지의 시간(분)입니다. 만료되면 사용자는 계속하려면 로그인해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3985
msgid ""
"Numerical input in minutes. Default is **43200** (30 days). Minimum value"
" is **5** minutes, and a value of **0** sets the time as unlimited."
msgstr "분 단위 숫자 입력. 기본값은 **43200**(30일)입니다. 최솟값은 **5**분이며, **0** 값은 시간을 무제한으로 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3982
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``SessionIdleTimeoutInMinutes`` > ``43200``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``SessionIdleTimeoutInMinutes`` > ``43200``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3983
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_SESSIONIDLETIMEOUTINMINUTES``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_SESSIONIDLETIMEOUTINMINUTES``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3992
msgid ""
"This setting has no effect when `extend session length with activity "
"<#extend-session-length-with-activity>`__ is set to **true**."
msgstr "`활동으로 세션 길이 연장 <#extend-session-length-with-activity>`__이 **true**로 설정된 경우 이 설정은 적용되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3993
msgid ""
"This setting applies to the webapp and the desktop app. For mobile apps, "
"use an :doc:`EMM provider </deployment-guide/mobile/deploy-mobile-apps-"
"using-emm-provider>` to lock the app when not in use."
"                                                |"
msgstr "이 설정은 웹 앱과 데스크톱 앱에 적용됩니다. 모바일 앱의 경우 사용하지 않을 때 앱을 잠그려면 :doc:`EMM 공급자 </deployment-guide/mobile/deploy-mobile-apps-using-emm-provider>`를 사용하세요.                                                |"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3994
msgid ""
"In :doc:`high availability mode </administration-guide/scale/high-"
"availability-cluster-based-deployment>`, enable IP hash load balancing "
"for reliable timeout measurement."
msgstr ":doc:`고가용성 모드 </administration-guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-deployment>`에서는 신뢰할 수 있는 시간 초과 측정을 위해 IP 해시 부하 분산을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3999
msgid "Performance monitoring"
msgstr "성능 모니터링"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4004
msgid ""
"With self-hosted deployments, you can configure performance monitoring by"
" going to **System Console > Environment > Performance Monitoring**, or "
"by editing the ``config.json`` file as described in the following tables."
msgstr "셀프 호스팅 배포에서는 **System Console > Environment > Performance Monitoring**으로 이동하거나 다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집하여 성능 모니터링을 구성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4019
msgid ""
"Changes to configuration settings in this section require a server "
"restart before taking effect."
msgstr "이 섹션의 구성 설정을 변경하면 적용되기 전에 서버를 다시 시작해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4021
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`performance monitoring </administration-guide/scale/deploy-"
"prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring>` documentation to learn "
"more about setting up performance monitoring with Prometheus and Grafana."
" See the :doc:`collect performance metrics </administration-guide/scale"
"/collect-performance-metrics>` documentation to learn more about using "
"the Mattermost Metrics plugin."
msgstr "Prometheus와 Grafana로 성능 모니터링을 설정하는 방법에 대한 자세한 내용은 :doc:`성능 모니터링 </administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring>` 문서를 참조하세요. Mattermost Metrics 플러그인 사용에 대한 자세한 내용은 :doc:`성능 메트릭 수집 </administration-guide/scale/collect-performance-metrics>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4034
msgid "Enable performance monitoring"
msgstr "성능 모니터링 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4037
msgid "Enable or disable performance monitoring."
msgstr "성능 모니터링을 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4039
msgid "**true**: Performance monitoring data collection and profiling is enabled."
msgstr "**true**: 성능 모니터링 데이터 수집 및 프로파일링이 활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4041
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Mattermost performance monitoring is disabled."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST 성능 모니터링이 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4037
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4061
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4080
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4103
msgid "System Config path: **Environment > Performance Monitoring**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Environment > Performance Monitoring**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4038
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``MetricsSettings`` > ``Enable`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``MetricsSettings`` > ``Enable`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4039
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_ENABLE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_ENABLE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4045
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`performance monitoring </administration-guide/scale/deploy-"
"prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring>` documentation to learn "
"more."
msgstr "자세한 내용은 :doc:`성능 모니터링 </administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4058
msgid "Enable client performance monitoring"
msgstr "클라이언트 성능 모니터링 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4061
msgid "Enable or disable client performance monitoring."
msgstr "클라이언트 성능 모니터링을 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4063
msgid ""
"**true**: Client performance monitoring data collection and profiling is "
"enabled."
msgstr "**true**: 클라이언트 성능 모니터링 데이터 수집 및 프로파일링이 활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4065
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Mattermost client performance monitoring is "
"disabled."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST 클라이언트 성능 모니터링이 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4062
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``MetricsSettings`` > ``EnableClientMetrics`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``MetricsSettings`` > ``EnableClientMetrics`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4063
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_ENABLECLIENTMETRICS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_ENABLECLIENTMETRICS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4077
msgid "Client side user ids"
msgstr "클라이언트 측 사용자 ID"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4080
msgid ""
"A list of comma-separated user IDs you want to track for client-side "
"webapp metrics."
msgstr "클라이언트 측 웹 앱 메트릭을 추적하려는 쉼표로 구분된 사용자 ID 목록입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4083
msgid "Limited to 5 user IDs. Blank by default."
msgstr "사용자 ID 5개로 제한됩니다. 기본값은 비어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4081
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``MetricsSettings`` > ``ClientSideUserIds``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``MetricsSettings`` > ``ClientSideUserIds``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4082
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_CLIENTSIDEUSERIDS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_CLIENTSIDEUSERIDS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4088
msgid "This setting only applies when ``EnableClientMetrics`` is set to ``true``."
msgstr "이 설정은 ``EnableClientMetrics``가 ``true``로 설정된 경우에만 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4089
msgid ""
"Each user ID should correspond to a valid user in the Mattermost system. "
"For example, "
"``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_CLIENTSIDEUSERIDS=\"user1,user2,user3\"``."
msgstr "각 사용자 ID는 OKR.BEST 시스템의 유효한 사용자와 일치해야 합니다. 예: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_CLIENTSIDEUSERIDS=\"user1,user2,user3\"``."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4090
msgid ""
"The total number of user IDs is limited to 5 to ensure performance. "
"Adding more IDs can overwhelm Prometheus due to high label cardinality. "
"To avoid performance issues, we recommend minimizing changes to this "
"list."
msgstr "성능을 보장하기 위해 사용자 ID의 총 수는 5개로 제한됩니다. ID를 더 추가하면 높은 레이블 카디널리티로 인해 Prometheus에 과부하가 걸릴 수 있습니다. 성능 문제를 피하기 위해 이 목록의 변경을 최소화할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4100
msgid "Listen address"
msgstr "수신 주소"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4103
msgid ""
"The port the Mattermost server will listen on to expose performance "
"metrics, when enabled."
msgstr "활성화된 경우 OKR.BEST 서버가 성능 메트릭을 노출하기 위해 수신할 포트입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4106
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **8067**."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **8067**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4104
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``MetricsSettings`` > ``ListenAddress`` > "
"``8067``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``MetricsSettings`` > ``ListenAddress`` > ``8067``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4105
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_LISTENADDRESS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_LISTENADDRESS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4111
msgid ""
"``ListenAddress`` accepts a port only. It doesn’t take an IP/host. If you"
" need to restrict interfaces, do so via your OS firewall or reverse "
"proxy."
msgstr "``ListenAddress``는 포트만 허용합니다. IP/호스트는 사용하지 않습니다. 인터페이스를 제한해야 하는 경우 OS 방화벽이나 리버스 프록시를 통해 수행하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4112
msgid ""
"The address uses a ``host:port`` format. Use ``:8067`` to listen on all "
"interfaces on port **8067**, or use ``localhost:8067`` to restrict to "
"**localhost** only."
msgstr "주소는 ``host:port`` 형식을 사용합니다. 포트 **8067**의 모든 인터페이스에서 수신하려면 ``:8067``을 사용하고, **localhost**로만 제한하려면 ``localhost:8067``을 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4122
msgid "Block profile rate"
msgstr "블록 프로파일 비율"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4125
msgid ""
"Control how often Mattermost collects data about delays caused by "
"blocking operations within Mattermost (such as when one part of the "
"program has to wait for another). Default is **0** (profiling is "
"disabled)."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 내의 차단 작업(예: 프로그램의 한 부분이 다른 부분을 기다려야 하는 경우)으로 인한 지연에 대한 데이터를 OKR.BEST가 수집하는 빈도를 제어합니다. 기본값은 **0**(프로파일링 비활성화)입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4130
msgid ""
"The profiler aims to sample an average of one blocking event per rate "
"nanoseconds spent blocked."
msgstr "프로파일러는 차단된 rate 나노초당 평균 하나의 차단 이벤트를 샘플링하는 것을 목표로 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4133
msgid "Default is **0**."
msgstr "기본값은 **0**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4125
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4477
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4628
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4647
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4663
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4680
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4700
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4720
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4742
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4768
msgid "System Config path: **N/A**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **N/A**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4126
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``MetricsSettings`` > ``BlockProfileRate`` > "
"``0``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``MetricsSettings`` > ``BlockProfileRate`` > ``0``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4127
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_BLOCKPROFILERATE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_BLOCKPROFILERATE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4138
msgid ""
"This setting isn't available in the System Console and can only be set in"
" ``config.json``."
msgstr "이 설정은 관리자 도구에서 사용할 수 없으며 ``config.json``에서만 설정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4139
msgid ""
"Only adjust this if you’re diagnosing performance issues and know how to "
"analyze profiling data. The value represents how frequently Mattermost "
"records blocking events in its performance profile:"
msgstr "성능 문제를 진단하고 프로파일링 데이터를 분석하는 방법을 알고 있는 경우에만 이를 조정하세요. 값은 OKR.BEST가 성능 프로파일에 차단 이벤트를 기록하는 빈도를 나타냅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4141
msgid "Set to 0 to record no blocking events (profiling is disabled)."
msgstr "차단 이벤트를 기록하지 않으려면 0으로 설정합니다(프로파일링 비활성화)."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4142
msgid "Set to 1 to record every blocking event (profiling is fully enabled)."
msgstr "모든 차단 이벤트를 기록하려면 1로 설정합니다(프로파일링 완전 활성화)."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4143
msgid ""
"Set to a higher number to record only a fraction of events (useful for "
"sampling instead of full profiling)."
msgstr "이벤트의 일부만 기록하려면 더 높은 숫자로 설정합니다(전체 프로파일링 대신 샘플링에 유용)."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4153
msgid "Enable notification monitoring"
msgstr "알림 모니터링 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4156
msgid "Enable or disable notification metrics data collection."
msgstr "알림 메트릭 데이터 수집을 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4159
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Mattermost notification data collection is "
"enabled for client-side web and desktop app users."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 클라이언트 측 웹 및 데스크톱 앱 사용자에 대해 OKR.BEST 알림 데이터 수집이 활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4162
msgid "**false**: Mattermost notification data collection is disabled."
msgstr "**false**: OKR.BEST 알림 데이터 수집이 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4156
msgid "System Config path: **Site Configuration > Notifications**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Site Configuration > Notifications**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4157
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``MetricsSettings`` > "
"``EnableNotificationMetrics`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``MetricsSettings`` > ``EnableNotificationMetrics`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4158
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_ENABLENOTIFICATIONMETRICS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_ENABLENOTIFICATIONMETRICS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4168
msgid "``MetricsSettings.Enable`` must be set to ``true``"
msgstr "``MetricsSettings.Enable``이 ``true``로 설정되어 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4169
msgid "The ``NotificationMonitoring`` feature flag must be set to ``true``"
msgstr "``NotificationMonitoring`` 기능 플래그가 ``true``로 설정되어 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4171
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`performance monitoring <administration-guide/scale/deploy-"
"prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring:getting started>` "
"documentation to learn more about Mattermost Notification Health metrics."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 알림 상태 메트릭에 대한 자세한 내용은 :ref:`성능 모니터링 <administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring:getting started>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4177
msgid "Developer"
msgstr "개발자"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4179
msgid ""
"With self-hosted deployments, you can configure developer mode by going "
"to **System Console > Environment > Developer**, or by editing the "
"``config.json`` file as described in the following tables. Changes to "
"configuration settings in this section require a server restart before "
"taking effect."
msgstr "셀프 호스팅 배포에서는 **System Console > Environment > Developer**로 이동하거나 다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집하여 개발자 모드를 구성할 수 있습니다. 이 섹션의 구성 설정을 변경하면 적용되기 전에 서버를 다시 시작해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4192
msgid "Enable testing commands"
msgstr "테스트 명령 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4195
msgid "Enable or disable the ``/test`` slash command."
msgstr "``/test`` 슬래시 명령을 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4197
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** The ``/test`` slash command is enabled to load "
"test accounts and test data. Use this setting only in isolated non-"
"production environments and never in production."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 테스트 계정과 테스트 데이터를 로드하기 위해 ``/test`` 슬래시 명령이 활성화됩니다. 이 설정은 격리된 비프로덕션 환경에서만 사용하고 프로덕션에서는 절대 사용하지 마세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4202
msgid "**false**:  The ``/test`` slash command is disabled."
msgstr "**false**: ``/test`` 슬래시 명령이 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4195
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4220
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4244
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4271
msgid "System Config path: **Environment > Developer**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Environment > Developer**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4196
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableTesting`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableTesting`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4197
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLETESTING``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLETESTING``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4217
msgid "Enable developer mode"
msgstr "개발자 모드 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4220
msgid "Enable or disable developer mode."
msgstr "개발자 모드를 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4222
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Javascript errors are shown in a banner at the "
"top of Mattermost the user interface. Not recommended for use in "
"production."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** Javascript 오류가 OKR.BEST 사용자 인터페이스 상단의 배너에 표시됩니다. 프로덕션에서 사용하는 것은 권장하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4226
msgid "**false**: Users are not alerted to Javascript errors."
msgstr "**false**: 사용자에게 Javascript 오류가 알림으로 표시되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4221
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableDeveloper`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableDeveloper`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4222
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEDEVELOPER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEDEVELOPER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4241
msgid "Enable client debugging"
msgstr "클라이언트 디버깅 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4244
msgid ""
"Enable or disable client-side debugging settings found in **Settings > "
"Advanced > Debugging** for individual users."
msgstr "개별 사용자에 대해 **Settings > Advanced > Debugging**에 있는 클라이언트 측 디버깅 설정을 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4248
msgid "**true**: Those settings are visible and can be enabled by users."
msgstr "**true**: 해당 설정이 표시되며 사용자가 활성화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4250
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Those settings are hidden and disabled."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 해당 설정이 숨겨지고 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4245
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``EnableClientPerformanceDebugging`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableClientPerformanceDebugging`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4246
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLECLIENTPERFORMANCEDEBUGGING``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLECLIENTPERFORMANCEDEBUGGING``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4254
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`client debugging <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-"
"advanced-options:performance debugging>` documentation to learn more."
msgstr "자세한 내용은 :ref:`클라이언트 디버깅 <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-advanced-options:performance debugging>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4264
msgid "Allow untrusted internal connections"
msgstr "신뢰할 수 없는 내부 연결 허용"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4268
msgid ""
"This setting is intended to prevent users located outside your local "
"network from using the Mattermost server to request confidential data "
"from inside your network. Care should be used when configuring this "
"setting to prevent unintended access to your local network."
msgstr "이 설정은 로컬 네트워크 외부에 있는 사용자가 OKR.BEST 서버를 사용하여 네트워크 내부에서 기밀 데이터를 요청하는 것을 방지하기 위한 것입니다. 로컬 네트워크에 대한 의도하지 않은 액세스를 방지하기 위해 이 설정을 구성할 때 주의해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4271
msgid ""
"Limit the ability for the Mattermost server to make untrusted requests "
"within its local network. A request is considered “untrusted” when it’s "
"made on behalf of a client."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 서버가 로컬 네트워크 내에서 신뢰할 수 없는 요청을 할 수 있는 기능을 제한합니다. 요청이 클라이언트를 대신하여 이루어지면 “신뢰할 수 없는” 것으로 간주됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4272
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``AllowedUntrustedInternalConnections`` > ``\"\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``AllowedUntrustedInternalConnections`` > ``\"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4273
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ALLOWEDUNTRUSTEDINTERNALCONNECTIONS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ALLOWEDUNTRUSTEDINTERNALCONNECTIONS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4277
msgid ""
"This setting is a whitelist of local network addresses that can be "
"requested by the Mattermost server. It’s configured as a whitespace-"
"separated list of hostnames, IP addresses, and CIDR ranges that can be "
"accessed."
msgstr "이 설정은 OKR.BEST 서버가 요청할 수 있는 로컬 네트워크 주소의 화이트리스트입니다. 액세스할 수 있는 호스트 이름, IP 주소, CIDR 범위의 공백으로 구분된 목록으로 구성됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4279
msgid ""
"Requests that can only be configured by system admins are considered "
"trusted and won't be affected by this setting. Trusted URLs include ones "
"used for OAuth login or for sending push notifications."
msgstr "시스템 관리자만 구성할 수 있는 요청은 신뢰할 수 있는 것으로 간주되며 이 설정의 영향을 받지 않습니다. 신뢰할 수 있는 URL에는 OAuth 로그인 또는 푸시 알림 전송에 사용되는 URL이 포함됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4281
msgid ""
"The following features make untrusted requests and are affected by this "
"setting:"
msgstr "다음 기능은 신뢰할 수 없는 요청을 하며 이 설정의 영향을 받습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4283
msgid ""
"Integrations using webhooks, slash commands, or message actions. This "
"prevents them from requesting endpoints within the local network."
msgstr "웹훅, 슬래시 명령 또는 메시지 작업을 사용하는 통합. 이는 로컬 네트워크 내의 엔드포인트를 요청하지 못하도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4284
msgid ""
"Link previews. When a link to a local network address is posted in a chat"
" message, this prevents a link preview from being displayed."
msgstr "링크 미리보기. 로컬 네트워크 주소에 대한 링크가 채팅 메시지에 게시되면 링크 미리보기가 표시되지 않도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4285
msgid ""
"The local :doc:`image proxy </deployment-guide/server/image-proxy>`. If "
"the local image proxy is enabled, images located on the local network "
"cannot be used by integrations or posted in chat messages."
msgstr "로컬 :doc:`이미지 프록시 </deployment-guide/server/image-proxy>`. 로컬 이미지 프록시가 활성화된 경우 로컬 네트워크에 있는 이미지는 통합에서 사용하거나 채팅 메시지에 게시할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4287
msgid "Some examples of when you may want to modify this setting include:"
msgstr "이 설정을 수정하려는 경우의 몇 가지 예는 다음과 같습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4289
msgid ""
"When installing a plugin that includes its own images, such as "
"`Matterpoll <https://github.com/matterpoll/matterpoll>`__, you'll need to"
" add the Mattermost server’s domain name to this list."
msgstr "`Matterpoll <https://github.com/matterpoll/matterpoll>`__과 같이 자체 이미지를 포함하는 플러그인을 설치할 때 이 목록에 OKR.BEST 서버의 도메인 이름을 추가해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4290
msgid ""
"When running a bot or webhook-based integration on your local network, "
"you’ll need to add the hostname of the bot/integration to this list."
msgstr "로컬 네트워크에서 봇 또는 웹훅 기반 통합을 실행할 때 이 목록에 봇/통합의 호스트 이름을 추가해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4291
msgid ""
"If your network is configured in such a way that publicly-accessible web "
"pages or images are accessed by the Mattermost server using their "
"internal IP address, the hostnames for those servers must be added to "
"this list."
msgstr "공개적으로 액세스할 수 있는 웹 페이지나 이미지가 OKR.BEST 서버에서 내부 IP 주소를 사용하여 액세스되도록 네트워크가 구성된 경우 해당 서버의 호스트 이름을 이 목록에 추가해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4295
msgid ""
"The public IP of the Mattermost application server itself is also "
"considered a reserved IP."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 애플리케이션 서버 자체의 공용 IP도 예약된 IP로 간주됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4296
msgid ""
"Use whitespaces instead of commas to list the hostnames, IP addresses, or"
" CIDR ranges. For example: ``webhooks.internal.example.com``, "
"``127.0.0.1``, or ``10.0.16.0/28``."
msgstr "호스트 이름, IP 주소 또는 CIDR 범위를 나열할 때 쉼표 대신 공백을 사용합니다. 예: ``webhooks.internal.example.com``, ``127.0.0.1`` 또는 ``10.0.16.0/28``."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4297
msgid "IP address and domain name rules are applied before host resolution."
msgstr "IP 주소 및 도메인 이름 규칙은 호스트 확인 전에 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4298
msgid ""
"CIDR rules are applied after host resolution, and only CIDR rules require"
" DNS resolution."
msgstr "CIDR 규칙은 호스트 확인 후에 적용되며, CIDR 규칙만 DNS 확인이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4299
msgid ""
"Mattermost attempts to match IP addresses and hostnames without even "
"resolving. If that fails, Mattermost resolve using the local resolver (by"
" reading the ``/etc/hosts`` file first), then checking for matching CIDR "
"rules. For example, if the domain “webhooks.internal.example.com” "
"resolves to the IP address ``10.0.16.20``, a webhook with the URL "
"``https://webhooks.internal.example.com/webhook`` can be whitelisted "
"using ``webhooks.internal.example.com``, or ``10.0.16.16/28``, but not "
"``10.0.16.20``."
msgstr "OKR.BEST는 확인하지 않고도 IP 주소와 호스트 이름을 일치시키려고 시도합니다. 실패하면 OKR.BEST는 로컬 확인자를 사용하여(먼저 ``/etc/hosts`` 파일을 읽어서) 확인한 다음 일치하는 CIDR 규칙을 확인합니다. 예를 들어, 도메인 “webhooks.internal.example.com”이 IP 주소 ``10.0.16.20``으로 확인되는 경우 URL ``https://webhooks.internal.example.com/webhook``을 가진 웹훅은 ``webhooks.internal.example.com`` 또는 ``10.0.16.16/28``을 사용하여 화이트리스트에 추가할 수 있지만 ``10.0.16.20``은 사용할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4302
msgid "Mobile security"
msgstr "모바일 보안"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/ent-adv.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Enterprise Advanced "
"<https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__ plans"
msgstr "|plans-img-yellow| `Enterprise Advanced <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__ 플랜에서 사용 가능"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4307
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v10.7 and mobile app v2.27, you can configure biometric "
"authentication, prevent Mattermost use on jailbroken or rooted devices, "
"and can block screen captures without relying on an EMM Provider. "
"Configure these options by going to **System Console > Environment > "
"Mobile Security**, or by editing the ``config.json`` file as described in"
" the following tables. Changes to configuration settings in this section "
"require a server restart and require users to restart their mobile app or"
" log out and back in before taking effect."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v10.7 및 모바일 앱 v2.27부터 EMM 공급자에 의존하지 않고 생체 인증을 구성하고, 탈옥되거나 루팅된 기기에서 OKR.BEST 사용을 방지하고, 화면 캡처를 차단할 수 있습니다. **System Console > Environment > Mobile Security**로 이동하거나 다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집하여 이러한 옵션을 구성합니다. 이 섹션의 구성 설정을 변경하면 적용되기 전에 서버를 다시 시작해야 하며 사용자가 모바일 앱을 다시 시작하거나 로그아웃했다가 다시 로그인해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4320
msgid "Enable biometric authentication"
msgstr "생체 인증 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4323
msgid ""
"Enforce biometric authentication, with PIN/passcode fallback, before "
"accessing the app. Users will be prompted based on session activity and "
"server switching rules."
msgstr "앱에 액세스하기 전에 PIN/암호 폴백과 함께 생체 인증을 적용합니다. 사용자는 세션 활동 및 서버 전환 규칙에 따라 프롬프트가 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4328
msgid "**true**: Biometric authentication is enabled."
msgstr "**true**: 생체 인증이 활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4330
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Biometric authentication is disabled."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 생체 인증이 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4323
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4358
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4389
msgid "System Config path: **Environment > Mobile Security**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Environment > Mobile Security**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4324
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``NativeAppSettings`` > "
"``MobileEnableBiometrics`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``NativeAppSettings`` > ``MobileEnableBiometrics`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4325
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_NATIVEAPPSETTINGS_MOBILEENABLEBIOMETRICS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_NATIVEAPPSETTINGS_MOBILEENABLEBIOMETRICS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4336
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4372
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4403
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4429
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4453
msgid ""
"Changing this configuration setting takes effect when mobile users "
"restart their Mattermost mobile app or log out and log back in."
msgstr "이 구성 설정을 변경하면 모바일 사용자가 OKR.BEST 모바일 앱을 다시 시작하거나 로그아웃했다가 다시 로그인할 때 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4337
msgid "Users must authenticate in the following situations:"
msgstr "사용자는 다음 상황에서 인증해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4339
msgid ""
"Adding a new server: When a new server is added to the mobile app and "
"biometric authentication is enabled."
msgstr "새 서버 추가: 모바일 앱에 새 서버가 추가되고 생체 인증이 활성화된 경우."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4340
msgid ""
"Opening the mobile app: At app launch when the active server requires "
"authentication."
msgstr "모바일 앱 열기: 활성 서버에 인증이 필요한 경우 앱 실행 시."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4341
msgid ""
"Returning after background use: After the app has been in the background "
"for 5 minutes or more and the active server requires authentication."
msgstr "백그라운드 사용 후 복귀: 앱이 5분 이상 백그라운드에 있었고 활성 서버에 인증이 필요한 경우."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4342
msgid ""
"Using multiple servers: When accessing a server for the first time, after"
" 5 minutes of inactivity on a server, and when the last authentication "
"attempt fails."
msgstr "여러 서버 사용: 서버에 처음 액세스할 때, 서버에서 5분간 비활성 상태가 지난 후, 마지막 인증 시도가 실패한 경우."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4355
msgid "Enable jailbreak/root protection"
msgstr "탈옥/루트 보호 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4358
msgid ""
"Prevent access to the app on devices detected as jailbroken or rooted. If"
" a device fails the security check, users will be denied access or "
"prompted to switch to a compliant server."
msgstr "탈옥되거나 루팅된 것으로 감지된 기기에서 앱에 대한 액세스를 방지합니다. 기기가 보안 검사에 실패하면 사용자는 액세스가 거부되거나 규정을 준수하는 서버로 전환하라는 프롬프트가 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4364
msgid "**true**: Jailbreak/Root protection is enabled."
msgstr "**true**: 탈옥/루트 보호가 활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4366
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Jailbreak/Root protection is disabled."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 탈옥/루트 보호가 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4359
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``NativeAppSettings`` > "
"``MobileJailbreakProtection`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``NativeAppSettings`` > ``MobileJailbreakProtection`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4360
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_NATIVEAPPSETTINGS_MOBILEJAILBREAKPROTECTION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_NATIVEAPPSETTINGS_MOBILEJAILBREAKPROTECTION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4373
msgid ""
"See the `Expo SDK documentation "
"<https://docs.expo.dev/versions/latest/sdk/device/#deviceisrootedexperimentalasync>`_"
" to learn more about how checks are performed for this functionality."
msgstr "이 기능에 대한 검사가 수행되는 방식에 대한 자세한 내용은 `Expo SDK 문서 <https://docs.expo.dev/versions/latest/sdk/device/#deviceisrootedexperimentalasync>`_를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4386
msgid "Prevent screen capture"
msgstr "화면 캡처 방지"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4389
msgid ""
"Block screenshots and screen recordings when using the mobile app. "
"Screenshots will appear blank, and screen recordings will blur (iOS) or "
"show a black screen (Android). Also applies when switching apps."
msgstr "모바일 앱을 사용할 때 스크린샷과 화면 녹화를 차단합니다. 스크린샷은 비어 있게 표시되고 화면 녹화는 흐리게 처리되거나(iOS) 검은 화면이 표시됩니다(Android). 앱 전환 시에도 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4395
msgid "**true**: Screen capture blocking is enabled."
msgstr "**true**: 화면 캡처 차단이 활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4397
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Screen capture blocking is disabled."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 화면 캡처 차단이 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4390
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``NativeAppSettings`` > "
"``MobilePreventScreenCapture`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``NativeAppSettings`` > ``MobilePreventScreenCapture`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4391
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_NATIVEAPPSETTINGS_MOBILEPREVENTSCREENCAPTURE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_NATIVEAPPSETTINGS_MOBILEPREVENTSCREENCAPTURE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4415
msgid "Enable secure file preview on mobile"
msgstr "모바일에서 보안 파일 미리보기 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4417
msgid ""
"This setting improves an organization's mobile security posture by "
"restricting file access while still allowing essential file viewing "
"capabilities."
msgstr "이 설정은 필수 파일 보기 기능은 계속 허용하면서 파일 액세스를 제한하여 조직의 모바일 보안 태세를 개선합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4420
msgid ""
"**true**: Prevents file downloads, previews, and sharing for most file "
"types, even when the :ref:`Allow file downloads on mobile "
"<administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:allow file "
"downloads on mobile>` configuration setting is enabled. Allows in-app "
"previews for PDFs, videos, and images only. Files are stored temporarily "
"in the app's cache and cannot be exported or shared."
msgstr "**true**: :ref:`모바일에서 파일 다운로드 허용 <administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:allow file downloads on mobile>` 구성 설정이 활성화된 경우에도 대부분의 파일 형식에 대한 파일 다운로드, 미리보기, 공유를 방지합니다. PDF, 비디오, 이미지에 대한 인앱 미리보기만 허용합니다. 파일은 앱의 캐시에 임시로 저장되며 내보내거나 공유할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4425
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Secure file preview mode is disabled."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 보안 파일 미리보기 모드가 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4420
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4444
msgid "System Config path: **Site Configuration > File sharing and downloads**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Site Configuration > File sharing and downloads**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4421
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > "
"``MobileEnableSecureFilePreview`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``MobileEnableSecureFilePreview`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4422
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_MOBILEENABLESECUREFILEPREVIEW``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_MOBILEENABLESECUREFILEPREVIEW``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4441
msgid "Allow PDF link navigation on mobile"
msgstr "모바일에서 PDF 링크 탐색 허용"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4444
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Enables tapping links inside PDFs on mobile when "
"Secure File Preview Mode is active. Links will open in the device browser"
" or supported app."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 보안 파일 미리보기 모드가 활성화된 경우 모바일에서 PDF 내부의 링크 탭을 활성화합니다. 링크는 기기 브라우저 또는 지원되는 앱에서 열립니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4447
msgid ""
"**false**: Disables link navigation in PDFs when Secure File Preview Mode"
" is active."
msgstr "**false**: 보안 파일 미리보기 모드가 활성화된 경우 PDF의 링크 탐색을 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4445
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > "
"``MobileAllowPdfLinkNavigation`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``FileSettings`` > ``MobileAllowPdfLinkNavigation`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4446
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_MOBILEALLOWPDFLINKNAVIGATION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_MOBILEALLOWPDFLINKNAVIGATION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4454
msgid ""
"This setting has no effect when the `Secure file preview on mobile "
"<#enable-secure-file-preview-on-mobile>`__ configuration setting is "
"disabled."
msgstr "`모바일에서 보안 파일 미리보기 <#enable-secure-file-preview-on-mobile>`__ 구성 설정이 비활성화된 경우 이 설정은 적용되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4459
msgid "config.json-only settings"
msgstr "config.json 전용 설정"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4461
msgid ""
"The following self-hosted deployment settings are only configurable in "
"the ``config.json`` file and are not available in the System Console."
msgstr "다음 셀프 호스팅 배포 설정은 ``config.json`` 파일에서만 구성할 수 있으며 관리자 도구에서는 사용할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4474
msgid "Disable Customer Portal requests"
msgstr "고객 포털 요청 비활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4477
msgid "Enable or disable customer portal requests."
msgstr "고객 포털 요청을 활성화하거나 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4480
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Server-side requests made to the customer portal "
"are disabled."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 고객 포털에 대한 서버 측 요청이 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4483
msgid ""
"**false**: Server-side requests made to the Mattermost Customer Portal "
"are enabled, but will always fail in air-gapped and restricted deployment"
" environments."
msgstr "**false**: Mattermost 고객 포털에 대한 서버 측 요청이 활성화되지만, 에어 갭 및 제한된 배포 환경에서는 항상 실패합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4478
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``CloudSettings`` > ``Disable`` > ``true,``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``CloudSettings`` > ``Disable`` > ``true,``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4479
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_CLOUDSETTINGS_DISABLE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_CLOUDSETTINGS_DISABLE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4491
msgid "Cloud admins can’t modify this configuration setting."
msgstr "클라우드 관리자는 이 구성 설정을 수정할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4504
msgid "Enable API team deletion"
msgstr "API 팀 삭제 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4507
msgid "Allow permanent team deletion via API."
msgstr "API를 통한 영구 팀 삭제를 허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4509
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**true**: Team and system admins (or users with appropriate permissions) "
"can call ``api/v4/teams/{teamid}?permanent=true`` or use ``mmctl team "
"delete`` to permanently delete a team."
msgstr "**true**: 팀 및 시스템 관리자(또는 적절한 권한이 있는 사용자)는 ``api/v4/teams/{teamid}?permanent=true``를 호출하거나 ``mmctl team delete``를 사용하여 팀을 영구적으로 삭제할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4512
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Endpoint not available; "
"``api/v4/teams/{teamid}`` still soft deletes a team."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 엔드포인트를 사용할 수 없으며, ``api/v4/teams/{teamid}``는 여전히 팀을 소프트 삭제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4508
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableAPITeamDeletion`` "
"> ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableAPITeamDeletion`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4518
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4545
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4573
msgid ""
"This setting isn’t available in the System Console and can only be set in"
" ``config.json``."
msgstr "이 설정은 관리자 도구에서 사용할 수 없으며 ``config.json``에서만 설정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4531
msgid "Enable API user deletion"
msgstr "API 사용자 삭제 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4534
msgid "Allow permanent user deletion via API."
msgstr "API를 통한 영구 사용자 삭제를 허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4536
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**true**: System admins (or users with appropriate permissions) can call "
"``api/v4/users/{userid}?permanent=true`` or use ``mmctl user delete`` to "
"permanently delete a user."
msgstr "**true**: 시스템 관리자(또는 적절한 권한이 있는 사용자)는 ``api/v4/users/{userid}?permanent=true``를 호출하거나 ``mmctl user delete``를 사용하여 사용자를 영구적으로 삭제할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4539
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Endpoint not available; "
"``api/v4/users/{userid}`` still soft deletes a user."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 엔드포인트를 사용할 수 없으며, ``api/v4/users/{userid}``는 여전히 사용자를 소프트 삭제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4535
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableAPIUserDeletion`` "
"> ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableAPIUserDeletion`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4558
msgid "Enable API channel deletion"
msgstr "API 채널 삭제 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4561
msgid "Allow permanent channel deletion via API."
msgstr "API를 통한 영구 채널 삭제를 허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4563
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**true**: System admins (or users with appropriate permissions) can call "
"``api/v4/channels/{channelid}?permanent=true`` or use ``mmctl channel "
"delete`` to permanently delete a channel."
msgstr "**true**: 시스템 관리자(또는 적절한 권한이 있는 사용자)는 ``api/v4/channels/{channelid}?permanent=true``를 호출하거나 ``mmctl channel delete``를 사용하여 채널을 영구적으로 삭제할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4567
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Endpoint not available; "
"``api/v4/channels/{channelid}`` still soft deletes a channel."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 엔드포인트를 사용할 수 없으며, ``api/v4/channels/{channelid}``는 여전히 채널을 소프트 삭제합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4562
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``EnableAPIChannelDeletion`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableAPIChannelDeletion`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4586
msgid "Enable desktop app developer mode"
msgstr "데스크톱 앱 개발자 모드 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4588
msgid ""
"From Desktop App v5.10, this setting enables developer debugging options "
"available by going to the **View > Developer Tools** menu in the "
"Mattermost desktop app."
msgstr "데스크톱 앱 v5.10부터 이 설정은 OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱의 **View > Developer Tools** 메뉴로 이동하여 사용할 수 있는 개발자 디버깅 옵션을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4590
msgid ""
"This setting isn't available in the System Console and can only be "
"enabled in ``config.json`` by setting the environment variable "
"``MM_DESKTOP_DEVELOPER_MODE`` to ``true``. This setting is disabled by "
"default."
msgstr "이 설정은 관리자 도구에서 사용할 수 없으며 환경 변수 ``MM_DESKTOP_DEVELOPER_MODE``를 ``true``로 설정하여 ``config.json``에서만 활성화할 수 있습니다. 이 설정은 기본적으로 비활성화되어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4592
msgid ""
"**True**: Unlocks the following options in the Desktop App for the "
"purposes of troubleshooting and debugging. You should only enable this "
"setting if instructed to by a Mattermost developer:"
msgstr "**True**: 문제 해결 및 디버깅 목적으로 데스크톱 앱에서 다음 옵션을 잠금 해제합니다. Mattermost 개발자가 지시한 경우에만 이 설정을 활성화해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4594
msgid ""
"**Browser Mode Only**: Completely disables the preload script and stops "
"web app components from knowing they're in the desktop app. This option "
"should be the best indicator of whether a web app component is causing "
"performance and/or memory retention issues. This option disables "
"notifications, cross-tab navigation, unread/mentions badges, the calls "
"widget, and breaks resizing on macOS."
msgstr "**Browser Mode Only**: 사전 로드 스크립트를 완전히 비활성화하고 웹 앱 구성 요소가 데스크톱 앱에 있다는 것을 인식하지 못하도록 합니다. 이 옵션은 웹 앱 구성 요소가 성능 및/또는 메모리 유지 문제를 일으키는지 여부를 가장 잘 나타내는 지표입니다. 이 옵션은 알림, 탭 간 탐색, 읽지 않음/멘션 배지, 통화 위젯을 비활성화하고 macOS에서 크기 조정을 중단시킵니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4595
msgid ""
"**Disable Notification Storage**: Turns off maps that hold references to "
"unread notifications until they've been selected & read. This option is "
"good for debugging in cases where Mattermost is holding onto too many "
"references to unused notifications."
msgstr "**Disable Notification Storage**: 읽지 않은 알림이 선택되어 읽힐 때까지 해당 참조를 보관하는 맵을 끕니다. 이 옵션은 OKR.BEST가 사용하지 않는 알림에 대한 너무 많은 참조를 보유하고 있는 경우 디버깅에 유용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4596
msgid ""
"**Disable User Activity Monitor**: Turns off the interval that checks "
"whether the user is away or not. This option is good for debugging "
"whether a user's availability status is causing unexpected desktop app "
"behavior."
msgstr "**Disable User Activity Monitor**: 사용자가 자리 비움 상태인지 여부를 확인하는 간격을 끕니다. 이 옵션은 사용자의 가용성 상태가 예기치 않은 데스크톱 앱 동작을 일으키는지 여부를 디버깅하는 데 유용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4597
msgid ""
"**Disable Context Menu**: Turns off the context menu attached to the "
"BrowserViews. This option is good as a library santity check."
msgstr "**Disable Context Menu**: BrowserViews에 연결된 컨텍스트 메뉴를 끕니다. 이 옵션은 라이브러리 정상성 검사에 유용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4598
msgid ""
"**Force Legacy Messaging API**: Forces the app to revert back to the old "
"messaging API instead of the newer contextBridge API. This option is a "
"good santity check to confirm whether the new API is responsible for "
"holding onto memory."
msgstr "**Force Legacy Messaging API**: 앱이 최신 contextBridge API 대신 이전 메시징 API로 되돌아가도록 강제합니다. 이 옵션은 새 API가 메모리를 보유하는 원인인지 확인하는 좋은 정상성 검사입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4599
msgid ""
"**Force New Messaging API**: Forces the app to use the contextBridge API "
"and completely disables the legacy one. This option forces off listeners "
"for the legacy API."
msgstr "**Force New Messaging API**: 앱이 contextBridge API를 사용하도록 강제하고 레거시 API를 완전히 비활성화합니다. 이 옵션은 레거시 API에 대한 리스너를 강제로 끕니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4601
msgid ""
"**False**: **(Default)** Developer debugging options are locked and "
"unavailable in the Desktop App."
msgstr "**False**: **(기본값)** 개발자 디버깅 옵션이 잠겨 있으며 데스크톱 앱에서 사용할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4604
msgid "Redis cache backend"
msgstr "Redis 캐시 백엔드"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4609
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v10.4, Mattermost Enterprise customers with self-hosted "
"deployments can configure `Redis <https://redis.io/>`_ (Remote Dictionary"
" Server) as an alternative cache backend. Redis is an open-source, in-"
"memory data structure store that can be used as a database, cache, and "
"message broker. It supports various data structures and is a top choice "
"for its performance because its able to store data in memory and provide "
"very quick data access."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v10.4부터 셀프 호스팅 배포가 있는 Mattermost Enterprise 고객은 `Redis <https://redis.io/>`_(Remote Dictionary Server)를 대체 캐시 백엔드로 구성할 수 있습니다. Redis는 데이터베이스, 캐시, 메시지 브로커로 사용할 수 있는 오픈 소스 인메모리 데이터 구조 저장소입니다. 다양한 데이터 구조를 지원하며 데이터를 메모리에 저장하고 매우 빠른 데이터 액세스를 제공할 수 있기 때문에 성능 면에서 최고의 선택입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4611
msgid ""
"Using Redis as a caching solution can help ensure that Mattermost for "
"enterprise-level deployments with high concurrency and large user bases "
"remains performant and efficient, even under heavy usage."
msgstr "Redis를 캐싱 솔루션으로 사용하면 동시성이 높고 사용자 기반이 큰 엔터프라이즈 수준 배포에서 OKR.BEST가 과도한 사용 중에도 성능과 효율성을 유지하도록 보장하는 데 도움이 됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4613
msgid ""
"Configure a Redis cache by editing the ``config.json`` file as described "
"in the following tables. Changes to configuration settings in this "
"section require a server restart before taking effect."
msgstr "다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집하여 Redis 캐시를 구성합니다. 이 섹션의 구성 설정을 변경하면 적용되기 전에 서버를 다시 시작해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4625
msgid "Cache type"
msgstr "캐시 유형"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4628
msgid "Define the cache type."
msgstr "캐시 유형을 정의합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4630
msgid "**lru**: **(Default)** Mattermost uses the in-memory cache store."
msgstr "**lru**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST가 인메모리 캐시 저장소를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4632
msgid "**redis**: Mattermost uses the configured Redis cache store."
msgstr "**redis**: OKR.BEST가 구성된 Redis 캐시 저장소를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4629
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``CacheSettings`` > ``CacheType,`` > ``lru``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``CacheSettings`` > ``CacheType,`` > ``lru``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4630
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_CACHESETTINGS_CACHETYPE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_CACHESETTINGS_CACHETYPE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4644
msgid "Redis address"
msgstr "Redis 주소"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4647
msgid "The hostname of the Redis host."
msgstr "Redis 호스트의 호스트 이름입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4648
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``CacheSettings`` > ``RedisAddress,``"
